#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.title"
msgstr "Ukuguqulwa kwamalungelo obunikazi kuyadingeka ukuze kuqinisekiswe ukuphepha kwezwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.tldr"
msgstr "TL;DR: Ama-LLM aseShayina (kufaka phakathi i-DeepSeek) aqeqeshwa ku-archive yami yezincwadi namaphepha engavumelekile — enkulu kunazo zonke emhlabeni. I-West idinga ukuvuselela umthetho wamalungelo obunikazi njengodaba lokuphepha kwezwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.subtitle"
msgstr "izihloko ezihambisana ne-TorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>eyokuqala</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>eyesibili</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text1"
msgstr "Akukapheli isikhathi eside, “imitatshana emnyama” yayisifa. I-Sci-Hub, isizindalwazi esikhulu esingekho emthethweni samaphepha ezemfundo, yayisiyekile ukuthatha imisebenzi emisha, ngenxa yezimangalo. “Z-Library”, umtapo wezincwadi omkhulu ongavumelekile wezincwadi, wabona abenzi bawo abasolwa beboshwa ngezinsolo zokwephula amalungelo obunikazi. Baphumelele ngokumangalisayo ukubaleka ukuboshwa kwabo, kodwa umtapo wabo awukho ngaphansi kosongo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text2"
msgstr "Ngesikhathi i-Z-Library ibhekene nokuvalwa, ngase ngivele ngikopishe yonke imitapo yayo futhi ngifuna ipulatifomu yokuyigcina. Lokho kwaba yisizathu sami sokuqala i-Archive ka-Anna: ukuqhubeka komsebenzi waleyo mizamo yangaphambilini. Selokhu sakhula saba umtapo wezincwadi omnyama omkhulu kunayo yonke emhlabeni, sigcina izincwadi ezingaphezu kwezigidi eziyi-140 ezine-copyright ezihlukahlukene — izincwadi, amaphepha ezemfundo, omagazini, amaphephandaba, nangaphezulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text3"
msgstr "Ithimba lami nami singabantu abakholelwa kakhulu. Sikholelwa ukuthi ukugcina nokusingatha la mafayela kulungile ngokokuziphatha. Imitatshana emhlabeni wonke ibona ukuncishiswa kwezimali, futhi asikwazi ukuthembela ifa lesintu ezinkampanini."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text4"
msgstr "Kwase kufika i-AI. Cishe zonke izinkampani ezinkulu ezakha ama-LLM zaxhumana nathi ukuze ziqeqeshe ngedatha yethu. Eziningi (kodwa hhayi zonke!) izinkampani ezise-US zaphinde zacabangela uma sezibone ubunjalo obungekho emthethweni bomsebenzi wethu. Ngokuphambene, izinkampani zaseShayina zamukela ngenjabulo iqoqo lethu, ngokusobala zingakhathazekile ngokusemthethweni kwalo. Lokhu kuyaphawuleka uma kubhekwa indima yaseShayina njengomshicileli cishe kuzo zonke izivumelwano ezinkulu zamalungelo obunikazi emhlabeni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text5"
msgstr "Sinikeze ukufinyelela okusheshayo cishe ezinkampanini ezingama-30. Eziningi zazo ziyizinkampani ze-LLM, kanti ezinye zingabathengisi bedatha, abazodayisa iqoqo lethu. Eziningi ziseShayina, nakuba sisebenze nezinkampani ezivela e-US, eYurophu, eRussia, eNingizimu Korea, naseJapane. I-DeepSeek <a %(arxiv)s>ivumile</a> ukuthi inguqulo yangaphambilini yaqeqeshwa engxenyeni yeqoqo lethu, nakuba ingathuli ngenguqulo yayo yakamuva (mhlawumbe nayo iqeqeshwe ngedatha yethu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text6"
msgstr "Uma iNtshonalanga ifuna ukuhlala phambili emjahweni we-LLMs, futhi ekugcineni, i-AGI, idinga ukubuyekeza isikhundla sayo mayelana namalungelo obunikazi, futhi ngokushesha. Noma ngabe uyavumelana nathi noma cha ngodaba lwethu lokuziphatha, lokhu sekuyindaba yezomnotho, ngisho neyokuphepha kwezwe. Zonke izikhungo zamandla zakha ososayensi abakhulu bokufakelwa, abahlaseli abakhulu, kanye nezempi ezinkulu. Inkululeko yolwazi isiphenduka indaba yokusinda kula mazwe — ngisho nendaba yokuphepha kwezwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text7"
msgstr "Ithimba lethu livela emhlabeni wonke, futhi asinakho ukuhambisana okukhethekile. Kodwa singakhuthaza amazwe anemithetho eqinile yamalungelo obunikazi ukuthi asebenzise lesi songo sokuba khona ukuze ayilungise. Ngakho-ke yini okufanele yenziwe?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text8"
msgstr "Isincomo sethu sokuqala silula: yehlisa isikhathi samalungelo obunikazi. E-US, amalungelo obunikazi anikezwa iminyaka engu-70 ngemuva kokushona kombhali. Lokhu kuyahlekisa. Singakwenza lokhu kuhambisane namalungelo obunikazi, anikezwa iminyaka engu-20 ngemuva kokufaka isicelo. Lokhu kufanele kube isikhathi esanele sokuthi ababhali bezincwadi, amaphepha, umculo, ubuciko, neminye imisebenzi yokudala, bakhokhelwe ngokugcwele ngemizamo yabo (kufaka phakathi amaphrojekthi wesikhathi eside njengokuguqulwa kwamafilimu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text9"
msgstr "Bese, okungenani, abenzi benqubomgomo kufanele bafake izikhala zokugcina ngobuningi nokusabalalisa imibhalo. Uma imali elahlekile evela kumakhasimende ngamanye iyinkinga enkulu, ukusatshalaliswa kwezinga lomuntu siqu kungahlala kuvinjelwe. Ngokuphenduka, labo abakwazi ukuphatha izinqolobane ezinkulu — izinkampani eziqeqesha ama-LLMs, kanye namalabhulali nezinye izinqolobane — bazovikelwa yilezi zikhala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text10"
msgstr "Amanye amazwe asevele enza inguqulo yalokhu. I-TorrentFreak <a %(torrentfreak)s>ibike</a> ukuthi i-China ne-Japan zethule izikhala ze-AI emthethweni wazo yamalungelo obunikazi. Akucaci kithi ukuthi lokhu kuhlangana kanjani nezivumelwano zamazwe ngamazwe, kodwa nakanjani kunikeza isivikelo ezinkampanini zabo zasekhaya, okuchaza lokho esikubonile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text11"
msgstr "Mayelana ne-Archive ka-Anna — sizoqhubeka nomsebenzi wethu ongaphansi komhlaba osuselwe ekuzimiseleni kokuziphatha. Nokho isifiso sethu esikhulu kakhulu ukufinyelela ekukhanyeni, futhi sandise umthelela wethu ngokusemthethweni. Sicela ulungise amalungelo obunikazi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
