msgstr "Le <a %(phiresky_github)s>ukuthunyelwa</a> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>umbono we-Gitlab</a>) lokhu konke esikufunayo, futhi ngaphezulu! Sithandile kakhulu izinketho zokubonisa eziguquguqukayo kakhulu (ngisho nokusekela ama-shaders enziwe ngokwezifiso), kodwa ngohlu olubanzi lwezinketho ezisethwe ngaphambilini. Siphinde sathanda ukuthi konke kuhamba ngokushesha futhi kuhlanzekile, ukufakwa okulula (okungadingi ngisho i-backend), imephu encane ehlakaniphile, kanye nencazelo ebanzi ku-<a %(phiresky_github)s>ibhulogi yabo</a>. Umsebenzi omangalisayo, futhi umnqobi ofanelwe kahle!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Indawo yesibili $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "Okunye <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>ukuthunyelwa</a> okumangalisayo. Akuguquguquki njengendawo yokuqala, kodwa empeleni sathanda ukuboniswa kwayo kwezinga eliphezulu ngaphezu kwendawo yokuqala (ijika eligcwalisa isikhala, imingcele, amalebula, ukuveza, ukuhamba, nokusondeza). <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s>Umbono</a> kaJoe Davis usithinte:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“Nakuba izikwele eziphelele nezikwele zilingana kahle ngokwezibalo, azinikezi indawo engcono kakhulu kumongo wemephu. Ngikholwa ukuthi ukungalingani okuhambisana nalezi zindlela ze-Hilbert noma i-Morton yakudala akuyona iphutha kodwa kuyisici. Njengoba nje umumo we-boot odumile wase-Italy uwenza uqashelwe ngokushesha emephini, 'izici' ezihlukile zalezi zindlela zingase zisebenze njengamaphuzu okukhumbula. Lokhu kuhluka kungathuthukisa inkumbulo yendawo futhi kusize abasebenzisi bazibeke, okungenzeka kwenze kube lula ukuthola izifunda ezithile noma ukubona amaphethini.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Futhi kusenamathuba amaningi okubona nokudweba, kanye ne-UI eshelelayo futhi enengqondo. Indawo yesibili eqinile!"

