#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.title"
msgstr "Ukuveza Zonke Izincwadi ze-ISBN — umklomelo ka-$10,000 ngo-2025-01-31"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.tldr"
msgstr "Lesi sithombe simelela uhlu lwezincwadi olukhulu kunawo wonke oluvulekile olwakhiwe emlandweni wesintu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text1"
msgstr "Lesi sithombe sinama-pixels angu-1000×800. I-pixel ngayinye imelela ama-ISBN angu-2,500. Uma sinedokhumenti ye-ISBN, senza leyo pixel ibe luhlaza kakhulu. Uma sazi ukuthi i-ISBN ikhishwe, kodwa asinayo ifayela elihambisanayo, senza ibe bomvu kakhulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text2"
msgstr "Ngaphansi kuka-300kb, lesi sithombe simelela ngokufingqiwe uhlu lwezincwadi olukhulu kunawo wonke oluvulekile olwakhiwe emlandweni wesintu (ama-GB ambalwa acebile agcwele ngokuphelele)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text3"
msgstr "Kubonisa futhi: kusekuningi okumele kwenziwe ekusekeleni izincwadi (sine-16% kuphela)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background"
msgstr "Umlando"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text1"
msgstr "I-Anna’s Archive ingafeza kanjani umgomo wayo wokusekela lonke ulwazi lwesintu, ngaphandle kokwazi ukuthi izincwadi ezisekhona? Sidinga uhlu lwe-TODO. Enye indlela yokuhlela lokhu ngokusebenzisa izinombolo ze-ISBN, ezisukela ngawo-1970 zabelwa zonke izincwadi ezishicilelwe (ezinhlobonhlobo zamazwe)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text2"
msgstr "Ayikho igunya eliphakathi elazi zonke izabelo ze-ISBN. Esikhundleni salokho, uhlelo olusakazekile, lapho amazwe ethola izilinganiso zezinombolo, abese eabela izilinganiso ezincane kubashicileli abakhulu, abangase bahlukanise izilinganiso kubashicileli abancane. Ekugcineni izinombolo ezithile zabelwa izincwadi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text3"
msgstr "Siqale ukwakha imephu ye-ISBNs <a %(blog)s>eminyakeni emibili edlule</a> ngokuhlola kwethu i-ISBNdb. Kusukela lapho, sihloliwe eminye imithombo ye-metadata eminingi, efana ne-<a %(blog_2)s>Worldcat</a>, Google Books, Goodreads, Libby, nokunye. Uhlu oluphelele lungatholakala kumakhasi e-“Datasets” kanye ne-“Torrents” ku-Anna’s Archive. Manje sesinokuhlanganiswa okukhulu kunakho konke okuvulekile, okulayishwayo kalula kwe-metadata yezincwadi (ngakho-ke ama-ISBNs) emhlabeni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text4"
msgstr "Sibhale <a %(blog)s>ngokuningiliziwe</a> mayelana nokuthi kungani sinendaba nokulondolozwa, nokuthi kungani sisesikhathini esibucayi. Manje kumele sihlonze izincwadi ezingavamile, ezingagxilile, nezisengozini eyingqayizivele bese sizilondoloza. Ukuba ne-metadata enhle kuzo zonke izincwadi emhlabeni kusiza ngalokho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing"
msgstr "Ukuveza"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text1"
msgstr "Ngaphandle kwesithombe esibanzi, singabheka nezinhlelo zedatha esizitholile. Sebenzisa i-dropdown nezinkinobho ukuze ushintshe phakathi kwazo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text2"
msgstr "Kukhona amaphethini amaningi athakazelisayo ongawabuka kulezi zithombe. Kungani kunokuhleleka kwemigqa namabhulokhi, okubonakala kwenzeka ngezilinganiso ezahlukene? Yiziphi izindawo ezingenalutho? Kungani ezinye izinhlelo zedatha zihlangene kangaka? Sizoshiya le mibuzo njengomsebenzi kubafundi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty"
msgstr "Umvuzo we-$10,000"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text1"
msgstr "Kukhona okuningi ongakuhlola lapha, ngakho-ke simemezela umvuzo wokuthuthukisa ukuboniswa okungenhla. Ngokungafani nemivuzo yethu eminingi, lo umvuzo unomkhawulo wesikhathi. Kufanele <a %(annas_archive)s>uthumele</a> ikhodi yakho evulekile ngo-2025-01-31 (23:59 UTC)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text2"
msgstr "Ukuthunyelwa okuhamba phambili kuzothola u-$6,000, indawo yesibili u-$3,000, kanti indawo yesithathu u-$1,000. Yonke imivuzo izoklonyeliswa kusetshenziswa i-Monero (XMR)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text3"
