msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.heading"
msgstr "Izinga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.text1"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, sahlala ezingeni elilula elincane. Likhululekile impela, alilawuli, futhi lisebenza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> I-AAC (Isiqukathi se-Archive ka-Anna) iyinto eyodwa equkethe <strong>metadata</strong>, futhi ngokuzithandela <strong>idatha ye-binary</strong>, kokubili okungaguquki. Inesikhombi esihlukile emhlabeni wonke, esibizwa ngokuthi <strong>AACID</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Iqoqo.</strong> I-AAC ngayinye ingeyeqoqo, elichazwa njengohlu lwe-AACs oluhambisana ngokomqondo. Lokho kusho ukuthi uma wenza ushintsho olubalulekile kufomethi ye-metadata, kufanele udale iqoqo elisha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>“amarekhodi” namaqoqo “amafayela”.</strong> Ngokwesiko, kuvame ukuba lula ukukhulula “amarekhodi” nama “fayela” njengamaqoqo ahlukene, ukuze akhululwe ngezikhathi ezihlukene, isb. ngokusekelwe kumazinga wokukopela. “Irekhodi” liwukuqoqwa kwe-metadata kuphela, okuqukethe ulwazi olufana nezihloko zezincwadi, ababhali, ama-ISBN, njll, kanti “amafayela” amaqoqo aqukethe amafayela uqobo (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Ifomethi ye-AACID injena: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Isibonelo, i-AACID yangempela esiyikhululile <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{iqoqo}</code>: igama leqoqo, elingase liqukathe izinhlamvu ze-ASCII, izinombolo, kanye nezimpawu zokudonsa phansi (kodwa hhayi izimpawu zokudonsa phansi eziphindwe kabili)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: inguqulo emfushane ye-ISO 8601, njalo ku-UTC, isibonelo <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Le nombolo kufanele ikhule ngokulandelana kokukhululwa ngakunye, nakuba incazelo yayo ingahluka ngeqoqo ngalinye. Siphakamisa ukusebenzisa isikhathi sokukopela noma sokukhiqiza i-ID."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: isihlonzi esithile seqoqo, uma kusebenza, isibonelo i-Z-Library ID. Kungase kungafakwa noma kufushaniswe. Kufanele kungafakwa noma kufushaniswe uma i-AACID ingedlula izinhlamvu eziyi-150."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: i-UUID kodwa icindezelwe ku-ASCII, isibonelo kusetshenziswa i-base57. Njengamanje sisebenzisa i-<a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> ilabhulali ye-Python."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>Ibanga le-AACID.</strong> Njengoba ama-AACID aqukethe izikhathi zokukhula ngokulandelana, singasebenzisa lokho ukukhombisa amabanga ngaphakathi kweqoqo elithile. Sisebenzisa leli fomat: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, lapho izikhathi zifakiwe. Lokhu kuyahambisana ne-ISO 8601 notation. Amabanga aqhubekayo, futhi angase agqagqane, kodwa uma kwenzeka ukugqagqana kufanele aqukathe amarekhodi afanayo nalawo akhululwe ngaphambilini kulelo qoqo (ngoba ama-AAC awaguquki). Amarekhodi alahlekile awavunyelwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Ifayela le-metadata.</strong> Ifayela le-metadata liqukethe i-metadata yebanga lama-AAC, leqoqo elithile. Lezi zinezici ezilandelayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.filename"
msgstr "Igama lefayela kufanele libe ibanga le-AACID, elandulelwe nge-<code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> bese lilandelwa nge-<code>.jsonl.zstd</code>. Isibonelo, esinye sezikhululwa zethu sibizwa ngokuthi<br><code><span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z</span>.jsonl.zst</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.jsonlines"
msgstr "Njengoba kukhonjisiwe ngesopele lefayela, uhlobo lwefayela luyi-<a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> ecindezelwe nge-<a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.fields"
msgstr "Into ngayinye ye-JSON kufanele iqukathe izinkambu ezilandelayo ezingeni eliphezulu: <strong>aacid</strong>, <strong>metadata</strong>, <strong>data_folder</strong> (okuyinketho). Azikho ezinye izinkambu ezivunyelwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.metadata"
msgstr "<code>metadata</code> iyi-metadata engahleliwe, ngokwezincazelo zeqoqo. Kufanele ihambisane ngokwezincazelo ngaphakathi kweqoqo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.data_folder"
msgstr "<code>data_folder</code> kuyinketho, futhi igama lefolda yedatha ye-binary equkethe idatha ye-binary ehambisanayo. Igama lefayela ledatha ye-binary ehambisanayo ngaphakathi kwaleyo folda yi-AACID yerekhodi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.prefix"
msgstr "Isandulela <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> singaguqulwa sibe igama lesikhungo sakho, isibonelo <code style=\"color: red\">my_institute_meta__</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Ifolda yedatha ye-binary.</strong> Ifolda enedatha ye-binary yebanga lama-AAC, leqoqo elithile. Lezi zinezici ezilandelayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Igama le-directory kufanele libe ibanga le-AACID, elandulelwe nge-<code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, futhi akukho isijobelelo. Isibonelo, esinye sezikhululwa zethu sangempela sine-directory ebizwa ngokuthi<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "I-directory kufanele iqukathe amafayela edatha kuwo wonke ama-AAC ngaphakathi kwebanga elishiwo. Ifayela ngalinye ledatha kufanele libe ne-AACID yalo njengegama lefayela (akukho izijobelelo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "Kuyelulekwa ukwenza lezi folda zibe lula ukuphatha ngosayizi, isibonelo zingadluli ku-100GB-1TB ngayinye, nakuba lesi siphakamiso singashintsha ngokuhamba kwesikhathi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Ama-Torrents.</strong> Amafayela e-metadata namafolda edatha ye-binary angahlanganiswa kuma-torrents, nge-torrent eyodwa ngefayela le-metadata, noma i-torrent eyodwa ngefolda yedatha ye-binary. Ama-torrents kufanele abe negama lefayela/ledirectory langempela kanye nesijobelelo <code>.torrent</code> njengegama lefayela lawo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Isibonelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Ake sibheke ukukhululwa kwethu kwakamuva kwe-Z-Library njengesibonelo. Kuqukethe amaqoqo amabili: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” kanye “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Lokhu kusivumela ukuthi sikopishe ngokuhlukile futhi sikhulule amarekhodi e-metadata kumafayela ezincwadi angempela. Njengoba kunjalo, sikhulule ama-torrents amabili anamafayela e-metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "Siphinde sakhulula iqoqo lama-torrents anamafolda edatha ye-binary, kodwa kuphela kweqoqo “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”, angu-62 esewonke:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Ngokusebenzisa <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> singabona ukuthi yini ekhona ngaphakathi:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Kulokhu, kuyimetadata yencwadi njengoba kubikwe yi-Z-Library. Ezingeni eliphezulu sinokuthi “aacid” kanye “metadata”, kodwa akukho “data_folder”, njengoba kungekho datha yebhayinari ehambisanayo. I-AACID iqukethe “22430000” njengo-ID oyinhloko, esingabona ukuthi ithathwe ku-“zlibrary_id”. Singalindela amanye ama-AAC kuleli qoqo ukuthi abe nesakhiwo esifanayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Manje ake sisebenzise <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Lena i-metadata encane kakhulu ye-AAC, nakuba iningi lale AAC litholakala kwenye indawo kufayela le-binary! Phela, sinendawo \"yefolda yedatha\" kulokhu, ngakho singalindela ukuthi idatha ye-binary ehambisanayo itholakale ku-<code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. I-\"metadata\" iqukethe i-\"zlibrary_id\", ngakho singayihlanganisa kalula ne-AAC ehambisanayo eqoqweni \"zlib_records\". Besingayihlanganisa ngezindlela eziningi ezahlukene, isibonelo nge-AACID — izinga alikubeki lokho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Qaphela ukuthi akudingekile ukuthi inkambu \"ye-metadata\" ibe yi-JSON uqobo. Ingaba intambo equkethe i-XML noma noma iyiphi enye ifomethi yedatha. Ungagcina ngisho nolwazi lwe-metadata ku-binary blob ehambisanayo, isibonelo uma kuyidatha eningi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Isiphetho"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Ngalesi simo, singakhipha izinguqulo ngokwengeziwe, futhi sengeze kalula imithombo emisha yedatha. Sesivele sinezinguqulo ezimbalwa ezijabulisayo ezisendleleni!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "Siyethemba futhi ukuthi kuzoba lula kwamanye amathala ezincwadi angaphansi komhlaba ukuveza iziqoqo zethu. Phela, inhloso yethu ukugcina ulwazi nesiko lomuntu kuze kube phakade, ngakho-ke ukuvama okungaphezulu kungcono."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Isibuyekezo sika-Anna: isilondolozi esivulekile ngokuphelele, i-ElasticSearch, izembozo zezincwadi ezingaphezu kuka-300GB"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "Besisebenza ubusuku nemini ukuhlinzeka ngenye indlela enhle nge-Archive ka-Anna. Nazi ezinye zezinto esizifezile muva nje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "Ngokuthi i-Z-Library yehla futhi abasunguli bayo (abathiwa) baboshwa, besisebenza ubusuku nemini ukuhlinzeka ngenye indlela enhle nge-Archive ka-Anna (asiyixhumanisi lapha, kodwa ungayifuna ku-Google). Nazi ezinye zezinto esizifezile muva nje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "I-Archive ka-Anna ivulekile ngokuphelele"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "Sikholelwa ukuthi ulwazi kufanele lube mahhala, futhi ikhodi yethu ayihlukile. Sikhulule yonke ikhodi yethu ku-Gitlab yethu yangasese: <a %(annas_archive)s>Isoftware ka-Anna</a>. Siphinde sisebenzise i-issue tracker ukuhlela umsebenzi wethu. Uma ufuna ukuzibandakanya nentuthuko yethu, le yindawo enhle yokuqala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Ukukunikeza ukunambitheka kwezinto esisebenza kuzo, thatha umsebenzi wethu wakamuva wokuthuthukisa ukusebenza kweklayenti. Njengoba singakafaki i-pagination okwamanje, besivame ukubuyisa amakhasi okusesha amade kakhulu, anemiphumela engu-100-200. Besingafuni ukuvala imiphumela yokusesha masinyane, kodwa lokhu bekusho ukuthi kuzokwehlisa amanye amadivayisi. Kulokhu, senze iqhinga elincane: sabeka imiphumela eminingi yokusesha kumazwana e-HTML (<code><!-- --></code>), bese sibhala i-Javascript encane ezobona ukuthi imuphi umphumela okufanele ubonakale, lapho sizosusa khona amazwana:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "I-DOM \"virtualization\" ifakwe emigqeni engu-23, asikho isidingo samalabhulali anobuciko! Lolu uhlobo lwekhodi esheshayo enengqondo oyithola uma unomkhawulo wesikhathi, nezinkinga zangempela ezidinga ukuxazululwa. Kubikwe ukuthi usesho lwethu manje lusebenza kahle kumadivayisi ahamba kancane!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Omunye umzamo omkhulu kwakuwukwenza ngokuzenzakalelayo ukwakha isizindalwazi. Lapho siqala, sasihlanganisa imithombo ehlukene ngokungahleliwe. Manje sifuna ukuyigcina ibuyekeziwe, ngakho sabhala izikripthi eziningi zokulanda i-metadata emisha kumafolokhwe amabili e-Library Genesis, futhi siyihlanganise. Inhloso akukhona nje ukwenza lokhu kube usizo kusilondolozi sethu, kodwa ukwenza izinto zibe lula kunoma ubani ofuna ukudlala nge-metadata yethala lezincwadi elingaphansi komhlaba. Inhloso kuzoba i-Jupyter notebook enazo zonke izinhlobo ze-metadata ezithakazelisayo ezitholakalayo, ukuze sikwazi ukwenza ucwaningo oluningi njengokuthola ukuthi <a %(blog)s>isiphesenti se-ISBNs sigcinwa kuze kube phakade</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, sihlaziye uhlelo lwethu lokunikela. Manje usungasebenzisa ikhadi lesikweletu ukufaka imali ngqo kumaphakethe ethu e-crypto, ngaphandle kokwazi okuningi nge-cryptocurrencies. Sizohlala siqapha ukuthi lokhu kusebenza kahle kangakanani empeleni, kodwa lokhu kuyinto enkulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "Shintshela ku-ElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "Enye yamathikithi ethu <a %(annas_archive)s> amathikithi </a> yayiyisikhwama sezinkinga ngohlelo lwethu lokusesha. Sasebenzisa usesho lwe-MySQL full-text, njengoba sonke idatha yethu yayiku-MySQL noma kunjalo. Kodwa yayinemikhawulo yayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Eminye imibuzo yayithatha isikhathi eside kakhulu, kuze kube seqophelweni lokuthi yayigcina zonke izixhumanisi ezivulekile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo i-MySQL inobude obuncane begama, noma inkomba yakho ingakhula kakhulu. Abantu babika ukuthi abakwazi ukusesha \"Ben Hur\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "Usesho lwalushesha kancane uma lulayishwe ngokuphelele kumemori, okwakudingeka ukuthi sithole umshini obizayo ukuze usebenze kulokhu, kanye nemiyalo ethile yokulayisha inkomba ekuqaleni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "Besingeke sikwazi ukuyandisa kalula ukuze sakhe izici ezintsha, njengokuhlanganiswa okungcono <a %(wikipedia_cjk_characters)s> kwezilimi ezingahlukanisiwe </a>, ukuhlunga/ukuhlukanisa, ukuhleleka, iziphakamiso zokuthi \"usho ukuthini\", ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, njalonjalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "Ngemuva kokukhuluma nochwepheshe abaningi, sathatha isinqumo sokusebenzisa i-ElasticSearch. Akukabi kuhle ngokuphelele (iziphakamiso zabo ezizenzakalelayo zokuthi \"usho ukuthini\" nezici zokugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo azinhle), kodwa sekube ngcono kakhulu kune-MySQL yokusesha. Asikabi <a %(youtube)s> nesiqiniseko esikhulu </a> sokuyisebenzisa kunoma iyiphi idatha ebalulekile (nakuba benze inqubekelaphambili enkulu <a %(elastic_co)s>), kodwa sekukonke sijabule kakhulu ngoshintsho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "Okwamanje, sisebenzise usesho olushesha kakhulu, ukusekelwa kwezilimi okungcono, ukuhleleka kokufaneleka okungcono, izinketho ezahlukene zokuhlunga, nokuhlunga ngohlobo lolimi/uhlobo lwenkathi/uhlobo lwefayela. Uma unentshisekelo yokuthi lokhu kusebenza kanjani, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s> bheka </a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s> lokhu </a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s> bheka </a>. Kuyatholakala kalula, nakuba kungadinga ezinye izinkomba…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "300GB+ yezembozo zezincwadi zikhishwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, siyajabula ukumemezela ukukhishwa okuncane. Ngokubambisana nabantu abasebenza nge-Libgen.rs fork, sabelana ngazo zonke izembozo zezincwadi zabo ngama-torrents ne-IPFS. Lokhu kuzohambisa umthwalo wokubuka izembozo phakathi kwemishini eminingi, futhi kuzogcina kangcono. Ezimweni eziningi (kodwa hhayi zonke), izembozo zezincwadi zifakiwe kumafayela ngokwawo, ngakho lokhu kuyidatha \"etholakalayo\". Kodwa ukuba nayo ku-IPFS kusasiza kakhulu ekusebenzeni kwansuku zonke kwe-Anna’s Archive kanye nezinhlobonhlobo ze-Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Njengenjwayelo, ungathola lokhu kukhishwa ku-Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kuthuthelwe ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s> Anna’s Archive </a>). Asizukuxhumanisa nakho lapha, kodwa ungakuthola kalula."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Ngethemba singakhululeka kancane, manje njengoba sinenye indlela enhle ye-Z-Library. Lo msebenzi awunakekeli kahle. Uma unentshisekelo yokusiza ngohlelo, ukusebenza kweseva, noma umsebenzi wokugcina, ngokuqinisekile xhumana nathi. Kusenezinto eziningi <a %(annas_archive)s> okufanele zenziwe </a>. Siyabonga ngentshisekelo yakho nokusekela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s> Reddit </a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "I-Anna’s Archive isekela umtapo wezincwadi omkhulu kunayo yonke emhlabeni wezincwadi ezimnyama (95TB) — ungakwazi ukusiza ukuwusabalalisa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Umtapo wezincwadi omkhulu kunayo yonke emhlabeni wezincwadi ezimnyama wawunendawo eyodwa yokuhluleka.. kuze kube namuhla."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s> Xoxa ku-Hacker News </a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Umtapo wezincwadi omkhulu kunayo yonke wezincwadi ezimnyama kungenzeka ukuthi ungowokuhlukana okuthile kwe-Library Genesis: Libgen.li. Umphathi oyedwa ophethe lesi siza wakwazi ukuqoqa iqoqo lezincwadi ezimangalisayo elingaphezu kwamafayela ayizigidi ezi-2, elilingana ne-95TB. Nokho, ngokungafani nezinye iziqoqo ze-Library Genesis, leli alitholakali ngobuningi ngama-torrents. Ungathola lezi zincwadi ezimnyama ngazinye kuphela ngesiphakeli sakhe esihamba kancane — indawo eyodwa yokuhluleka. Kuze kube namuhla!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "Kule posi sizokutshela kabanzi ngaleli qoqo, nangomkhankaso wethu wokuthola imali ukuze sisekele lo msebenzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>UDkt. Barbara Gordon uzama ukuzilahlekisa emhlabeni ojwayelekile womtapo wezincwadi…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Izinkomba ze-Libgen"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Okokuqala, ake sibheke emuva. Kungenzeka wazi i-Library Genesis ngenxa yeqoqo labo elikhulu lezincwadi. Abantu abambalwa bazi ukuthi amavolontiya e-Library Genesis adale amanye amaphrojekthi, njengokuqoqwa okukhulu kwamamagazini namadokhumenti ajwayelekile, isipele esigcwele se-Sci-Hub (ngokubambisana nomsunguli we-Sci-Hub, u-Alexandra Elbakyan), futhi impela, iqoqo elikhulu lamahlaya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "Ngasikhathi esithile abaqhubi abahlukene be-Library Genesis mirrors bahlukana, okwaholela esimweni samanje sokuba nezinkomba ezahlukene, zonke zisagcina igama elithi Library Genesis. Inkomba ye-Libgen.li inale qoqo lamahlaya kuphela, kanye nokuqoqwa okukhulu kwamamagazini (esiphinde sisebenze nakho)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Ukubambisana"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Ngenxa yobukhulu bayo, leli qoqo belilokhu lisohlwini lwethu lwezifiso, ngakho-ke ngemuva kokuphumelela kwethu ngokwenza isipele se-Z-Library, sabeka amehlo ethu kuleli qoqo. Ekuqaleni salikhipha ngqo, okwakuyinselele enkulu, njengoba iseva yabo yayingekho esimweni esihle. Sazuza cishe i-15TB ngale ndlela, kodwa kwakuhamba kancane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Ngenhlanhla, sikwazile ukuxhumana nomqhubi waleli thala, owavuma ukusithumelela yonke idatha ngqo, okwakushesha kakhulu. Kusathathe isikhathi esingaphezu konyaka ukuthutha nokucubungula yonke idatha, futhi cishe silahlekelwe yiyo yonke ngenxa yokonakala kwe-disk, okwakuzosho ukuqala phansi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Lolu lwazi lusenze sakholwa ukuthi kubalulekile ukukhipha le datha ngokushesha okukhulu, ukuze ikwazi ukuboniswa kabanzi. Sisondela kakhulu ezimweni ezimbili ezingenhlanhla zokulahlekelwa yilo lonke leli qoqo unomphela!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Iqoqo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Ukushesha kusho ukuthi iqoqo alihlelwanga kahle... Ake sibheke. Cabanga ukuthi sinohlelo lwefayela (okuyiqiniso esiluhlukanisa kuma-torrents):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Uhlaka lokuqala, <code>/repository</code>, luyingxenye ehlelekile yalokhu. Lolu hlaka luqukethe okuthiwa “izinkulungwane zamafolda”: amafolda ngamunye anezinkulungwane zamafayela, ahlelwe ngokulandelana kwenombolo ku-database. Uhlaka <code>0</code> luqukethe amafayela anama-comic_id 0–999, nokunye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Lolu uhlelo olufanayo olusetshenziswa yi-Library Genesis ekuqoqweni kwayo kwezincwadi eziqanjiwe nezingaqanjiwe. Umqondo ukuthi yonke “inkulungwane yefolda” iguqulwe ngokuzenzakalelayo ibe yi-torrent uma isigcwele."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Nokho, umqhubi we-Libgen.li akakaze enze ama-torrents aleli qoqo, ngakho-ke izinkulungwane zamafolda kungenzeka zaba yinkinga, futhi zanikela “kumafolda angahlelekile”. Lawa <code>/comics0</code> kuya ku <code>/comics4</code>. Zonke zinezakhiwo zamafolda ezihlukile, ezazibonakala zinengqondo ekuqoqeni amafayela, kodwa azinengqondo kakhulu kithi manje. Ngenhlanhla, i-metadata isabhekisela ngqo kuwo wonke la mafayela, ngakho-ke ukuhlelwa kwawo kudiski akubalulekile!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "I-metadata iyatholakala ngendlela ye-database ye-MySQL. Lokhu kungalandwa ngqo kuwebhusayithi ye-Libgen.li, kodwa sizokwenza kutholakale nakwi-torrent, kanye nethebula lethu elinazo zonke izihash ze-MD5."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis"
msgstr "Ukuhlaziywa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text1"
msgstr "Uma uthola i-95TB ifakwe ku-cluster yakho yokugcina, uzama ukuqonda ukuthi yini ekhona... Senze ukuhlaziywa ukubona ukuthi singanciphisa usayizi kancane yini, njengokukhipha okuphindaphindiwe. Nazi ezinye zezinto esizitholile:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item1"
msgstr "Okuphindaphindiwe kwe-semantic (ukuhlolwa okuhlukile kwencwadi efanayo) kungahlungwa ngokomqondo, kodwa kunzima. Lapho sibheka amahlaya ngesandla sithole okuningi okungamanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item2"
msgstr "Kukhona okuphindaphindiwe ngokwe-MD5 kuphela, okungase kube yize, kodwa ukukhipha lokho kungasinika kuphela cishe i-1% in yokonga. Kulesi sikali lokho kusengaba cishe i-1TB, kodwa futhi, kulesi sikali i-1TB ayibalulekile ngempela. Singathanda ukungazifaki engozini yokubhujiswa kwedatha ngalesi senzo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item3"
msgstr "Sithole inqwaba yedatha engeyona yezincwadi, njengamafilimu asuselwa kumahlaya. Lokho nakho kubonakala kuyize, njengoba lokhu sekutholakala kabanzi ngezinye izindlela. Nokho, sabona ukuthi asikwazi nje ukukhipha amafayela amafilimu, njengoba kukhona futhi <em>amahlaya asebenzisanayo</em> akhishwe kukhompyutha, okuthile okurekhodiwe futhi kwagcinwa njengamafilimu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item4"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, noma yini esingayisusa kuleli qoqo izongisindisa amaphesenti ambalwa kuphela. Bese sikhumbula ukuthi singabathandi bedatha, nabantu abazobe bebonisa lokhu nabo bangabathandi bedatha, ngakho-ke, “UTHINI, SUSA?!” :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text2"
msgstr "Ngakho-ke sikunikeza iqoqo eligcwele, elingashintshiwe. Kuyidatha eningi, kodwa sithemba ukuthi abantu abaningi bazokhathalela ukuyihlakaza noma kunjalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser"
msgstr "Umkhankaso Wokuthola Izimali"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text1"
msgstr "Sikhulula le datha ngezicucu ezinkulu. I-torrent yokuqala ingeyama-<code>/comics0</code>, esiyifake kufayela elilodwa elikhulu le-12TB .tar. Lokho kungcono kudrayivu yakho kanzima kanye nesoftware ye-torrent kunamafayela amancane amaningi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text2"
msgstr "Njengengxenye yokukhululwa lokhu, senza umkhankaso wokuthola izimali. Sifuna ukuqoqa u-$20,000 ukuze sikhokhele izindleko zokusebenza nezokuthenga zalesi siqoqo, kanye nokuvumela amaphrojekthi aqhubekayo nezizayo. Sinezinhlelo ezinkulu ezisebenzayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text3"
msgstr "<em>Ngubani engimsekela ngomnikelo wami?</em> Ngamafuphi: sisekela yonke ulwazi namasiko esintu, futhi sikwenza kutholakale kalula. Wonke amakhodi ethu nedatha yethu kuvulekile, siyiphrojekthi ephethwe ngokuphelele ngabazithandela, futhi sesisindise amabhuku angama-125TB kuze kube manje (ngaphezu kwama-torrents akhona e-Libgen ne-Scihub). Ekugcineni sakha i-flywheel evumela futhi ekhuthaza abantu ukuthi bathole, baskena, futhi basindise wonke amabhuku emhlabeni. Sizobhala ngohlelo lwethu olukhulu esikhathini esizayo. :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text4"
msgstr "Uma unikeza umnikelo wobulungu be-12 izinyanga “Amazing Archivist” ($780), uzokwazi <strong>“ukuthatha i-torrent”</strong>, okusho ukuthi sizofaka igama lakho lomsebenzisi noma umlayezo kufayela le-torrent elilodwa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text5"
msgstr "Unganikela ngokuvakashela <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a> bese uchofoza inkinobho ethi “Donate”. Siphinde sifune abanye abazithandela: onjiniyela besoftware, abacwaningi bezokuphepha, ochwepheshe bezohwebo abangaziwa, nabahumushi. Ungasisekela futhi ngokuhlinzeka ngezinsizakalo zokusingatha. Futhi-ke, sicela uhlakaze ama-torrents ethu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Siyabonga kubo bonke asebesisekele ngokomusa! Niyenza umehluko ngempela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
msgstr "Nansi ama-torrents akhululiwe kuze kube manje (sisasebenza kokunye):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text8"
msgstr "Wonke ama-torrents angatholakala ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a> ngaphansi kwe-“Datasets” (asixhumanisi khona ngqo, ukuze izixhumanisi zaleli bhulogi zingasuswa ku-Reddit, Twitter, njll). Kusuka lapho, landela isixhumanisi kuwebhusayithi ye-Tor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next"
msgstr "Kuyini okulandelayo?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text1"
msgstr "Iqoqo lama-torrents lihle kakhulu ekugcinweni kwesikhathi eside, kodwa akukuhle kangako ekufinyeleleni nsuku zonke. Sizosebenzisana nabalingani bokusingatha ukuze sithole yonke le datha kuwebhu (kusukela I-Archive ka-Anna ayisingathi lutho ngqo). Vele uzokwazi ukuthola lezi zixhumanisi zokulanda ku-Archive ka-Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text2"
msgstr "Siphinde simeme wonke umuntu ukuthi enze izinto ngale datha! Sisize ukuyihlaziya kangcono, ukuyiphinda, ukuyifaka ku-IPFS, ukuyihlanganisa kabusha, ukuqeqesha amamodeli akho e-AI ngayo, nokunye. Konke kungokwakho, futhi asikwazi ukulinda ukubona ukuthi uzokwenza ini ngayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text3"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, njengoba kushiwo ngaphambili, sisenezinhlelo ezinkulu ezizayo (uma <em>othile</em> angakwazi <em>ngokungahlosi</em> ukusithumelela idumpu le-<em>ACS4 database ethile</em>, uyazi ukuthi ungathola kuphi…), kanye nokwakha i-flywheel yokugcina wonke amabhuku emhlabeni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text4"
msgstr "Ngakho hlala ulindile, sisanda kuqala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.title"
msgstr "Izincwadi ezintsha ezi-3x zengezwe ku-Pirate Library Mirror (+24TB, izincwadi eziyizigidi ezi-3.8)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text1"
msgstr "Ekukhululweni kwasekuqaleni kwe-Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kuthuthelwe ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>), senze isibuko se-Z-Library, iqoqo elikhulu lezincwadi ezingekho emthethweni. Njengesikhumbuzo, lokhu yikho esakubhala kulokhu okuthunyelwe kwebhulogi yasekuqaleni:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text1"
msgstr "I-Z-Library iyilabhulali edumile (futhi engekho emthethweni). Bathathe iqoqo le-Library Genesis balenze litholakale kalula. Ngaphezu kwalokho, baye baba ngempumelelo ekutholeni izincwadi ezintsha, ngokukhuthaza abasebenzisi abanikela ngezinsiza ezihlukahlukene. Njengamanje abanikeli lezi zincwadi ezintsha ku-Library Genesis. Futhi ngokungafani ne-Library Genesis, abenzi iqoqo labo libe lula ukulinganisa, okuthinta ukugcinwa okubanzi. Lokhu kubalulekile kumodeli yabo yebhizinisi, njengoba bekhokhisa imali yokufinyelela iqoqo labo ngobuningi (ngaphezu kwezincwadi eziyi-10 ngosuku)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text2"
msgstr "Asenzi izinqumo zokuziphatha mayelana nokukhokhisa imali yokufinyelela ngobuningi eqoqweni lezincwadi ezingekho emthethweni. Akungabazeki ukuthi i-Z-Library ibe yimpumelelo ekwandiseni ukufinyelela kolwazi, nasekutholeni izincwadi eziningi. Silapha nje ukwenza ingxenye yethu: ukuqinisekisa ukugcinwa kwesikhathi eside kwalesi siqoqo esizimele."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text2"
msgstr "Lelo qoqo libuyela emuva maphakathi no-2021. Okwamanje, i-Z-Library ikhule ngesivinini esishaqisayo: bangeze cishe izincwadi ezintsha eziyizigidi ezi-3.8. Kukhona okuphindaphindiwe lapho, yebo, kodwa iningi lalo libonakala liyizincwadi ezintsha ezisemthethweni, noma izithombe ezisezingeni eliphezulu zezincwadi ezazithunyelwe ngaphambilini. Lokhu kungenxa enkulu yokwanda kwenani labaphathi abazithandela e-Z-Library, kanye nohlelo lwabo lokulayisha ngobuningi olune-deduplication. Sifisa ukubabongela ngalezi zimpumelelo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text3"
msgstr "Siyajabula ukwazisa ukuthi sithole zonke izincwadi ezafakwa ku-Z-Library phakathi kwesibuko sethu sokugcina no-August 2022. Siphinde sabuyela emuva saqoqa ezinye izincwadi esaziphutha okokuqala. Sekukonke, leli qoqo elisha lilinganiselwa ku-24TB, elikhulu kakhulu kunelokugcina (7TB). Isibuko sethu manje sesingu-31TB ngokuphelele. Futhi, sikhishwe kabusha ku-Library Genesis, njengoba sekukhona ama-torrents atholakalayo alelo qoqo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text4"
msgstr "Sicela uye ku-Pirate Library Mirror ukuze ubheke iqoqo elisha (EDIT: selithuthelwe ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>). Kukhona ulwazi oluningi lapho mayelana nokuthi amafayela ahlelwe kanjani, nokuthi yini esishintshile kusukela ngesikhathi sokugcina. Asizukuxhumanisa nakho kusuka lapha, njengoba lokhu kuyisiza sebhulogi esingaphethe izinto ezingekho emthethweni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text5"
msgstr "Vele, ukuhlwanyela nakho kuyindlela enhle yokusisiza. Siyabonga kubo bonke abahlwanyela ama-torrents ethu angaphambilini. Siyabonga ngempendulo enhle, futhi siyajabula ukuthi kunabantu abaningi abanendaba nokulondolozwa kolwazi namasiko ngale ndlela engajwayelekile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s> Reddit </a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.title"
msgstr "Indlela yokuba umqoqi wezincwadi ongumgulukudu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.tldr"
msgstr "Inselelo yokuqala ingase imangaze. Akuyona inkinga yezobuchwepheshe, noma inkinga yezomthetho. Kuyinkinga yengqondo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates"
msgstr "Ngaphambi kokuba singene, izibuyekezo ezimbili ku-Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: selithuthelwe ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item1"
msgstr "Sithole iminikelo emikhulu kakhulu. Eyokuqala yayingu-$10k evela kumuntu ongaziwa obuye asekele \"bookwarrior\", umsunguli wokuqala we-Library Genesis. Sibonga kakhulu ku-bookwarrior ngokwenza le minikelo. Eyesibili yayingu-$10k evela komunye umnikeli ongaziwa, owasithinta ngemuva kokukhishwa kwethu kokugcina, futhi wakhuthazwa ukusiza. Siphinde sathola inani elincane leminikelo. Siyabonga kakhulu ngakho konke ukwesekwa kwenu okukhulu. Sinezinhlelo ezintsha ezijabulisayo ezizosekelwa yilezi, ngakho hlalani nilindile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item2"
msgstr "Sibe nezinselelo zobuchwepheshe ngobukhulu bokukhishwa kwethu kwesibili, kodwa ama-torrents ethu asekhona futhi ahlanyela manje. Sithole futhi isiphakamiso esihle esivela kumuntu ongaziwa sokuhlwanyela iqoqo lethu kumaseva abo anejubane eliphezulu kakhulu, ngakho senza ukulayisha okukhethekile kumishini yabo, ngemuva kwalokho wonke umuntu olayisha iqoqo kufanele abone ukuthuthuka okukhulu kwejubane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text1"
msgstr "Izincwadi eziphelele zingabhalwa mayelana ne-<em>kungani</em> kokulondolozwa kwedijithali ngokujwayelekile, kanye nokuba ngumqoqi wezincwadi ongumgulukudu ikakhulukazi, kodwa ake sinikeze isifundo esisheshayo kulabo abangajwayelekile kakhulu. Umhlaba ukhiqiza ulwazi namasiko amaningi kunanini ngaphambili, kodwa futhi amaningi alahleka kunanini ngaphambili. Isintu sithembele kakhulu ezinkampanini ezifana nabashicileli bezemfundo, izinsizakalo zokusakaza, nezinkampani zokuxhumana nabantu ngale ifa, futhi zivame ukungazibonakalisi njengabaphathi abakhulu. Bheka idokhumentari ethi Digital Amnesia, noma inkulumo yanoma iyiphi ka-Jason Scott."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text2"
msgstr "Kukhona izikhungo ezithile ezenza umsebenzi omuhle wokulondoloza okungakanani okungenzeka, kodwa ziboshwe ngumthetho. Njengamagulukudu, sisesimweni esiyingqayizivele sokulondoloza amaqoqo abangeke bawathinte, ngenxa yokuphoqelelwa kwamalungelo obunikazi noma ezinye izithiyo. Singaphinda futhi sibonise amaqoqo kaningi, emhlabeni wonke, ngaleyo ndlela sikhulise amathuba okulondolozwa kahle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text3"
msgstr "Okwamanje, asizukungena ezingxoxweni mayelana nezinzuzo nezinkinga zempahla yengqondo, ubuqotho bokwephula umthetho, ukucabanga ngokuvinjelwa, noma udaba lokufinyelela kolwazi namasiko. Ngakho konke lokho sekuxazululiwe, ake singene ku-<em>indlela</em>. Sizokwabelana ngokuthi ithimba lethu laba kanjani abaqoqi bezincwadi abangamagulukudu, nezifundo esizifundile endleleni. Kunezinselelo eziningi uma uqala lolu hambo, futhi ngethemba singakusiza kwezinye zazo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community"
msgstr "Umphakathi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text1"
msgstr "Inselele yokuqala ingase imangaze. Akuyona inkinga yezobuchwepheshe, noma inkinga yezomthetho. Kuyinkinga yengqondo: ukwenza lo msebenzi emthunzini kungaba yedwa kakhulu. Kuye ngokuthi uhlela ukwenzani, kanye nemodeli yakho yosongo, ungase udinge ukuba uqaphele kakhulu. Ngakolunye uhlangothi lwe-spectrum sinabantu abafana no-Alexandra Elbakyan*, umsunguli we-Sci-Hub, ovulelekile kakhulu ngemisebenzi yakhe. Kodwa usengozini enkulu yokuboshwa uma evakashela izwe laseNtshonalanga ngalesi sikhathi, futhi angase abhekane neminyaka eminingi ejele. Ingabe lokho kuyingozi ozimisele ukuyithatha? Thina sisesinye isikhala se-spectrum; siqaphela kakhulu ukuthi singashiyi noma yimuphi umkhondo, futhi sibe nokuphepha okuqinile kokusebenza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text2"
msgstr "* Njengoba kushiwo ku-HN ngu-\"ynno\", u-Alexandra ekuqaleni wayengafuni ukuba waziwe: \"Amasayithi akhe ayesethwe ukuthi akhiphe imilayezo yephutha eningiliziwe evela ku-PHP, kuhlanganise nendlela ephelele yefayela lomthombo eliphutha, elaliphansi kwe-directory /home/ringo-ring, elalingenziwa ithrekhi igama lomsebenzisi ayenalo ku-inthanethi kusayithi elingahlobene, elixhunywe egameni lakhe langempela. Ngaphambi kwalokhu kwembulwa, wayengaziwa.\" Ngakho-ke, sebenzisa amagama omsebenzisi angahleliwe kumakhompyutha owasebenzisayo kulokhu, uma kwenzeka wenza iphutha lokuhlela okuthile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text3"
msgstr "Nokho, leyo mfihlo iza nezindleko zengqondo. Abantu abaningi bayakuthanda ukuqashelwa ngomsebenzi abawenzayo, kodwa awukwazi ukuthatha udumo ngalokhu empilweni yangempela. Ngisho nezinto ezilula zingaba inselele, njengabangane abakubuza ukuthi ubuphakathi kwenzani (ngesinye isikhathi \"ukudlala ne-NAS yami / homelab\" kuyaguga)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text4"
msgstr "Yingakho kubaluleke kangaka ukuthola umphakathi othile. Ungayeka ukuphepha okuthile ngokusebenza ngokwethemba abanye abangane abaseduze kakhulu, obazi ukuthi ungabathemba kakhulu. Ngisho nalapho qaphela ukuthi ungabeki lutho ngokubhala, uma kwenzeka kufanele banikeze ama-imeyili abo eziphathimandla, noma uma amadivayisi abo ehlukunyezwa ngenye indlela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text5"
msgstr "Okungcono kakhulu ukuthola abanye abaphangi. Uma abangane bakho abaseduze benesifiso sokuhlanganyela nawe, kuhle! Ngaphandle kwalokho, ungase ukwazi ukuthola abanye ku-inthanethi. Ngeshwa lo mphakathi usenqabile. Kuze kube manje sithole abanye abambalwa kuphela abasebenza kulesi sikhala. Izindawo zokuqala ezinhle kubonakala kuyizinkundla ze-Library Genesis, kanye ne-r/DataHoarder. I-Archive Team nayo inabantu abacabanga ngendlela efanayo, nakuba basebenza ngaphakathi komthetho (ngisho noma kwezinye izindawo ezimpunga zomthetho). Izindawo zendabuko \"warez\" nezokuphanga nazo zinezakhamuzi ezicabanga ngendlela efanayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text6"
msgstr "Sivulekele imibono yokuthi singakhuthaza kanjani umphakathi futhi sihlolisise imibono. Zizwe ukhululekile ukusithumela umlayezo ku-Twitter noma ku-Reddit. Mhlawumbe singabamba uhlobo oluthile lwenkundla noma iqembu lokuxoxa. Inselele eyodwa ukuthi lokhu kungase kuvinjwe kalula uma usebenzisa amapulatifomu avamile, ngakho kuzofanele sikubambe thina uqobo. Kukhona futhi ukuhwebelana phakathi kokuba nalezi zingxoxo zibe zomphakathi ngokuphelele (ukuzibandakanya okungenzeka kakhulu) uma kuqhathaniswa nokwenza kube ngasese (ukungavumeli \"izisulu\" ezingaba khona ukuthi zazi ukuthi sizobakhuhla). Kuzofanele sicabange ngalokho. Sazise uma unentshisekelo kulokhu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects"
msgstr "Amaphrojekthi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text1"
msgstr "Uma senza iphrojekthi, inezigaba ezimbalwa:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase1"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa kwendawo / ifilosofi: Uthanda ukugxila kuphi, futhi kungani? Yiziphi izifiso zakho ezihlukile, amakhono, nezimo ongazisebenzisa ukuze uzuzwe?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase2"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa kwethagethi: Iyiphi iqoqo elithile ozolilingisa?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase3"
msgstr "Ukukhuhla i-metadata: Ukuqopha ulwazi mayelana namafayela, ngaphandle kokulanda amafayela (avame ukuba makhulu kakhulu) ngokwawo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase4"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa kwedatha: Ngokusekelwe ku-metadata, ukunciphisa ukuthi yiziphi idatha ezibaluleke kakhulu ukugcinwa manje. Kungaba yikho konke, kodwa ngokuvamile kunendlela enengqondo yokonga isikhala ne-bandwidth."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase5"
msgstr "Ukukhuhla idatha: Ukuthola idatha ngempela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase6"
msgstr "Ukusabalalisa: Ukupakisha ku-torrents, ukumemezela endaweni ethile, ukuthola abantu ukuthi basabalalise."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text2"
msgstr "Lezi azizigaba ezizimele ngokuphelele, futhi imvamisa ukuqonda okuvela esigabeni esilandelayo kukubuyisela esigabeni sangaphambilini. Isibonelo, ngesikhathi sokukhuhla i-metadata ungase ubone ukuthi ithagethi oyikhethile inezindlela zokuzivikela ezingaphezu kwamakhono akho (njengezithiyo ze-IP), ngakho ubuyela emuva uthole ithagethi ehlukile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain"
msgstr "1. Ukukhethwa kwendawo / ifilosofi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text1"
msgstr "Akunasidingo sokusindisa ulwazi namagugu amasiko, okungaba yinto esabekayo. Yingakho kuvame ukuba usizo ukuthatha isikhashana ucabange ngalokho ongakunikela ngakho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text2"
msgstr "Wonke umuntu unendlela ehlukile yokucabanga ngalokhu, kodwa nansi eminye imibuzo ongazibuza yona:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.why"
msgstr "Kungani unentshisekelo kulokhu? Yini ekuthokozisayo? Uma singathola iqembu labantu abaqoqa izinhlobo zezinto abazikhathalelayo, lokho kungamboza okuningi! Uzokwazi okuningi kunomuntu ojwayelekile mayelana nentshisekelo yakho, njengokuthi yiziphi idatha ezibalulekile ukugcinwa, yiziphi iziqoqo ezinhle nemiphakathi eku-inthanethi, njalonjalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.skills"
msgstr "Yiziphi amakhono onawo ongawasebenzisa ukuze uzuzise? Isibonelo, uma unguchwepheshe wezokuphepha ku-inthanethi, ungathola izindlela zokunqoba ukuvinjelwa kwe-IP ezindaweni eziphephile. Uma umuhle ekuhleleni imiphakathi, mhlawumbe ungabutha abantu abathile ndawonye ngenhloso ethile. Kuyasiza ukwazi okuthile ngohlelo, noma nje ukuze ugcine ukuphepha okuhle kokusebenza kulo lonke le nqubo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.time"
msgstr "Unesikhathi esingakanani salokhu? Iseluleko sethu kungaba ukuqala kancane bese wenza amaphrojekthi amakhulu njengoba ujwayela, kodwa kungathatha isikhathi esiningi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.target"
msgstr "Yiziphi izindawo eziphezulu ongagxila kuzo? Uma uzosebenzisa amahora angu-X ekugcineni izincwadi ngokungemthetho, ungathola kanjani \"inzuzo enkulu\"?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.thinking"
msgstr "Yiziphi izindlela ezihlukile ocabanga ngazo ngalokhu? Kungenzeka ukuthi unemiqondo noma izindlela ezithakazelisayo abanye abangaziboni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text3"
msgstr "Esimweni sethu, sasikhathazekile ngokukhethekile ngokulondolozwa kwesayensi kwesikhathi eside. Sazi nge-Library Genesis, nokuthi yayiboniswa ngokuphelele kaningi ngama-torrents. Sasilithanda lelo cebo. Bese ngelinye ilanga, omunye wethu wazama ukuthola izincwadi zesayensi ku-Library Genesis, kodwa akazitholanga, okwenza kube nokungabaza ukuthi yayiphelele kangakanani ngempela. Sabe sesifuna lezo zincwadi ku-inthanethi, futhi sazithola kwezinye izindawo, okwakha isisekelo sephrojekthi yethu. Ngisho nangaphambi kokuba sazi nge-Z-Library, sasinecebo lokungazami ukuqoqa zonke lezo zincwadi mathupha, kodwa sigxile ekuboneni amaqoqo akhona, futhi siwafake ku-Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target"
msgstr "2. Ukukhetha okuhlosiwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text1"
msgstr "Ngakho-ke, sinendawo yethu esiyibhekile, manje iyiphi iqoqo elithile esizolilingisa? Kunezinto ezimbalwa ezenza kube yisibopho esihle:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.large"
msgstr "Enkulu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.unique"
msgstr "Eyingqayizivele: engakagciniwe kahle ngamanye amaphrojekthi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.accessible"
msgstr "Efinyelelekayo: ayisebenzisi izendlalelo eziningi zokuvikela ukuvimbela ukuthi ungakhiphi i-metadata yabo nedatha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.insight"
msgstr "Ukuqonda okukhethekile: unolwazi olukhethekile ngalesi sibopho, njengokuthi unokufinyelela okukhethekile kuleli qoqo, noma uthole ukuthi ungayinqoba kanjani izivikelo zabo. Lokhu akudingekile (iphrojekthi yethu ezayo ayenzi lutho olukhethekile), kodwa nakanjani kuyasiza!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text2"
msgstr "Lapho sithola izincwadi zethu zesayensi kumawebhusayithi ngaphandle kwe-Library Genesis, sizama ukuthola ukuthi zifinyelele kanjani ku-inthanethi. Sabe sesithola i-Z-Library, futhi sabona ukuthi nakuba izincwadi eziningi zingaqali ukuvela lapho, zigcina zifika lapho. Safunda ngobudlelwano bayo ne-Library Genesis, kanye nesakhiwo sokukhuthaza (sezezimali) kanye nesixhumi esibonakalayo somsebenzisi esiphakeme, kokubili okwenza kube iqoqo eliphelele kakhulu. Sabe sesenza okunye ukuqoqa metadata kanye nedatha, futhi sabona ukuthi singazungeza imikhawulo yokulanda ye-IP yabo, sisebenzisa ukufinyelela okukhethekile kwelinye lamalungu ethu kumaseva amaningi e-proxy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text3"
msgstr "Njengoba uhlola izindawo ezihlukene, kubalulekile kakade ukufihla imikhondo yakho ngokusebenzisa ama-VPNs namakheli e-imeyili alahlwayo, esizokhuluma ngawo kabanzi kamuva."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata"
msgstr "3. Ukuqoqa metadata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text1"
msgstr "Ake sibe nobuchwepheshe obuncane lapha. Ukuze siqoqe ngempela i-metadata kumawebhusayithi, sigcine izinto zilula kakhulu. Sisebenzisa izikripthi ze-Python, kwesinye isikhathi i-curl, kanye nesizindalwazi se-MySQL ukugcina imiphumela. Asikaze sisebenzise isofthiwe yokukhipha edidayo engakwazi ukubonisa amawebhusayithi ayinkimbinkimbi, njengoba kuze kube manje besidinga ukukhipha uhlobo olulodwa noma ezimbili zamakhasi ngokumane sibale ama-ids futhi sihluze i-HTML. Uma kungekho amakhasi alula okubalwa, khona-ke ungase udinge i-crawler efanele ezama ukuthola wonke amakhasi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text2"
msgstr "Ngaphambi kokuba uqale ukukhipha iwebhusayithi yonke, zama ukukwenza ngesandla isikhashana. Dlula kumakhasi ambalwa ukuze uzwe ukuthi lokho kusebenza kanjani. Kwesinye isikhathi uzothola izithiyo ze-IP noma ezinye izindlela ezithakazelisayo ngale ndlela. Kuyafana nokuqoqa idatha: ngaphambi kokungena kakhulu kulokhu okuhlosiwe, qiniseka ukuthi ungayilanda ngempumelelo idatha yayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text3"
msgstr "Ukuze uzungeze izithiyo, kunezinto ezimbalwa ongazama. Ingabe kukhona amanye amakheli e-IP noma amaseva agcina idatha efanayo kodwa angenazo izithiyo ezifanayo? Ingabe kukhona izindawo ze-API ezingavinjelwe, kanti ezinye zivinjelwe? Ngasiphi isilinganiso sokulanda i-IP yakho ivinjelwa, futhi isikhathi esingakanani? Noma awuvinjelwanga kodwa uyancishiswa? Kuthiwani uma udala i-akhawunti yomsebenzisi, izinto zishintsha kanjani lapho? Ungasebenzisa i-HTTP/2 ukugcina izixhumanisi zivulekile, futhi lokho kwandisa isilinganiso sokuthi ungacela amakhasi? Ingabe kukhona amakhasi abonisa amafayela amaningi ngasikhathi sinye, futhi ulwazi olukhona lapho lanele?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text4"
msgstr "Izinto ongase ufune ukuzigcina zifaka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.title"
msgstr "Isihloko"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.location"
msgstr "Ifayela / indawo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.id"
msgstr "ID: kungaba i-ID yangaphakathi, kodwa ama-ID afana ne-ISBN noma i-DOI ayasiza futhi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.size"
msgstr "Usayizi: ukubala ukuthi udinga malini isikhala sediski."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.hash"
msgstr "I-Hash (md5, sha1): ukuqinisekisa ukuthi ulilande kahle ifayela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.dates"
msgstr "Usuku olungeziwe/oluguquliwe: ukuze ukwazi ukubuyela kamuva futhi ulande amafayela ongakawalandeli ngaphambili (nakuba ungasebenzisa futhi i-ID noma i-hash kulokhu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.notes"
msgstr "Incazelo, isigaba, amathegi, ababhali, ulimi, njll."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text5"
msgstr "Ngokuvamile sikwenza lokhu ngezigaba ezimbili. Okokuqala silanda amafayela e-HTML angahluziwe, ngokuvamile ngqo ku-MySQL (ukugwema amafayela amancane amaningi, esikhuluma ngawo kabanzi ngezansi). Bese, esinyathelweni esihlukile, sidlula kulawo mafayela e-HTML futhi siwahluze abe amatafula e-MySQL angempela. Ngale ndlela akudingeki ukuthi ululande kabusha konke kusukela ekuqaleni uma uthola iphutha ekukhipheni ikhodi yakho, njengoba ungasebenzisa kabusha amafayela e-HTML ngekhodi entsha. Kuphinde kube lula ukuhlela isinyathelo sokucubungula, ngaleyo ndlela ulondoloze isikhathi (futhi ungabhala ikhodi yokucubungula ngenkathi ukukhipha kuqhubeka, esikhundleni sokuthi ubhale izinyathelo zombili ngasikhathi sinye)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text6"
msgstr "Okokugcina, qaphela ukuthi kwezinye izindawo ukuqoqa i-metadata kuphela okukhona. Kukhona amaqoqo amakhulu e-metadata angagcinwanga kahle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data"
msgstr "4. Ukukhetha idatha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text1"
msgstr "Imvamisa ungasebenzisa i-metadata ukuze uthole isethi yedatha efanele ukulanda. Ngisho noma ekugcineni ufuna ukulanda yonke idatha, kungaba usizo ukuhlela izinto ezibaluleke kakhulu kuqala, uma kwenzeka utholakala futhi izivikelo zithuthukiswa, noma ngoba ungase udinge ukuthenga amanye amadiski, noma nje ngoba kukhona okunye okuvela empilweni yakho ngaphambi kokuba ukwazi ukulanda konke."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text2"
msgstr "Isibonelo, iqoqo lingase libe nezinguqulo eziningi zento efanayo (njengencwadi noma ifilimu), lapho eyodwa ibhalwe njengokuthi iyikhwalithi engcono kakhulu. Ukulondoloza lezo zinguqulo kuqala kungaba nomqondo omkhulu. Ungase ekugcineni ufune ukulondoloza zonke izinguqulo, ngoba kwezinye izimo i-metadata ingase ibhalwe ngokungalungile, noma kungase kube nokuhwebelana okungaziwa phakathi kwezinguqulo (isibonelo, \"inguqulo engcono kakhulu\" ingase ibe ngcono ngezindlela eziningi kodwa ibe yimbi kwezinye izindlela, njengokuthi ifilimu inezinga eliphezulu kodwa ingenazo izihlokwana)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text3"
msgstr "Ungaphinda useshe isizindalwazi sakho se-metadata ukuthola izinto ezithakazelisayo. Iyiphi ifayela elikhulu kunawo wonke elibanjwe, futhi kungani likhulu kangaka? Iyiphi ifayela elincane kunawo wonke? Ingabe kukhona amaphethini athakazelisayo noma angalindelekile uma kuziwa kwezinye izigaba, izilimi, njalonjalo? Ingabe kukhona izihloko eziphindaphindayo noma ezifanayo kakhulu? Ingabe kukhona amaphethini lapho idatha yengezwe khona, njengosuku olulodwa lapho amafayela amaningi engezwa ngasikhathi sinye? Ungafunda okuningi ngokubheka isethi yedatha ngezindlela ezahlukene."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text4"
msgstr "Esimweni sethu, sahlukanisa izincwadi ze-Z-Library ngokumelene nama-hashes e-md5 ku-Library Genesis, ngaleyo ndlela silondoloza isikhathi esiningi sokulanda nesikhala sediski. Lesi yisimo esiyingqayizivele kakhulu kodwa. Ezimweni eziningi awekho ama-database aphelele okufayili asevele agcinwe kahle ngabanye abaphangi. Lokhu ngokwalo kuyithuba elikhulu kumuntu othile laphaya. Kungaba kuhle ukuba nesibuyekezo esivamile sezinto ezifana nomculo namafilimu asevele ahlwayelwe kabanzi kumawebhusayithi e-torrent, ngakho-ke ayizinto eziphansi ezibalulekile ukufaka kumirror yaphirate."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping"
msgstr "5. Ukukhipha idatha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text1"
msgstr "Manje usukulungele ukulanda idatha ngobuningi. Njengoba kushiwo ngaphambili, ngalesi sikhathi kufanele usulande ngesandla amafayela amaningi, ukuze uqonde kangcono ukuziphatha nemikhawulo yendawo eqondiwe. Nokho, kusazoba nezimanga ezikulindile uma usulanda amafayela amaningi ngasikhathi sinye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text2"
msgstr "Iseluleko sethu lapha ikakhulukazi ukusigcina silula. Qala ngokulanda nje iqoqo lamafayela. Ungasebenzisa i-Python, bese wandisa kumathredi amaningi. Kodwa kwesinye isikhathi ngisho nokulula kakhulu ukukhiqiza amafayela e-Bash ngqo kusuka kudathabheyisi, bese ugijima amaningi awo kumawindi amaningi wetheminali ukuze ukhule. Iqhinga lobuchwepheshe elisheshayo elifanele ukushiwo lapha ukusebenzisa i-OUTFILE ku-MySQL, ongayibhala noma kuphi uma ukhubaza \"secure_file_priv\" ku-mysqld.cnf (futhi qiniseka ukuthi ukhubaza/udlula i-AppArmor uma use-Linux)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text3"
msgstr "Sigcina idatha kumadiski aqinile alula. Qala nganoma yini onayo, bese wandisa kancane kancane. Kungaba yinto esabekayo ukucabanga ngokugcina amakhulu e-TB wedatha. Uma yilokho okukhona, vele uphumelele isethi enhle kuqala, bese esazisweni yakho ucele usizo ekugcineni okusele. Uma ufuna ukuthola amadiski aqinile amaningi ngokwakho, khona-ke i-r/DataHoarder inezinsiza ezinhle zokuthola amadili amahle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text4"
msgstr "Zama ukungakhathazeki kakhulu ngezinhlelo zefayela ezinhle. Kulula ukuwela emgodini wokumisa izinto ezifana ne-ZFS. Imininingwane eyodwa yezobuchwepheshe okufanele uyazi, ukuthi izinhlelo eziningi zefayela aziphathi kahle amafayela amaningi. Sithole ukuthi isixazululo esilula ukudala amafolda amaningi, isibonelo, ngezindawo ezihlukene ze-ID noma iziqalo ze-hash."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text5"
msgstr "Ngemuva kokulanda idatha, qiniseka ukuthi uhlole ubuqotho bamafayela usebenzisa ama-hash ku-metadata, uma etholakala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution"
msgstr "6. Ukusabalalisa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text1"
msgstr "Unedatha, ngaleyo ndlela unokuphatha isibuko sokuqala somhlaba esingekho emthethweni sesibopho sakho (cishe). Ngazo zonke izindlela ingxenye enzima kakhulu isidlulile, kodwa ingxenye enobungozi kakhulu isezandleni zakho. Phela, kuze kube manje ubulokhu ungabonakali; ubundiza ngaphansi kwe-radar. Konke obekufanele ukwenze bekungukusebenzisa i-VPN enhle ngaso sonke isikhathi, ungagcwalisi imininingwane yakho yomuntu siqu kunoma yiziphi izindlela (duh), futhi mhlawumbe usebenzisa iseshini yesiphequluli esikhethekile (noma ngisho nekhompyutha ehlukile)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text2"
msgstr "Manje kufanele usabalalise idatha. Esimweni sethu sifuna kuqala ukunikela ngezincwadi ku-Library Genesis, kodwa sathola ngokushesha ubunzima kulokho (ukuhlukaniswa kwezincwadi eziqanjiwe nezingenziwanga). Ngakho-ke sanquma ukusabalalisa sisebenzisa ama-torrents afana ne-Library Genesis. Uma unethuba lokunikela kuphrojekthi ekhona, lokho kungakongela isikhathi esiningi. Nokho, akukhona ama-mirror angakabi khona ahlelekile kahle njengamanje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text3"
msgstr "Ngakho-ke ake sithi unquma ukusabalalisa ama-torrents ngokwakho. Zama ukugcina lawo mafayela amancane, ukuze kube lula ukuwalilingisa kwamanye amawebhusayithi. Uzodinga ukuwuhlanyela ama-torrents ngokwakho, ngenkathi usahlala ungaziwa. Ungasebenzisa i-VPN (ngokufaka noma ngaphandle kokudlulisela izimbobo), noma ukhokhe nge-Bitcoins ehlanjululwe ku-Seedbox. Uma ungazi ukuthi amanye ala magama asho ukuthini, uzoba nenqwaba yokufunda okufanele ukwenze, ngoba kubalulekile ukuthi uqonde izingozi zokuhweba lapha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text4"
msgstr "Ungakwazi ukubamba amafayela e-torrent ngokwawo kumawebhusayithi akhona e-torrent. Esimweni sethu, sikhethe ukubamba iwebhusayithi, njengoba sifuna futhi ukusabalalisa ifilosofi yethu ngendlela ecacile. Ungakwenza lokhu ngokwakho ngendlela efanayo (sisebenzisa i-Njalla kumadomains ethu nokubamba, okukhokhelwa nge-Bitcoins ehlanjululwe), kodwa futhi zizwe ukhululekile ukuxhumana nathi ukuze sibambe ama-torrents akho. Sifuna ukwakha inkomba ebanzi yezibuko ezingekho emthethweni ngokuhamba kwesikhathi, uma lo mbono uthandwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text5"
msgstr "Ngokukhetha i-VPN, okuningi sekubhalwe ngalokhu kakade, ngakho sizophinda nje iseluleko esijwayelekile sokukhetha ngedumela. Izinqubomgomo zokungena ezingenazo izinkantolo ezihlolwe enkantolo ezineziqu ezinde zokuvikela ubumfihlo kuyindlela enobungozi obuphansi, ngokombono wethu. Qaphela ukuthi noma wenza konke kahle, awusoze wafinyelela engozini engu-zero. Isibonelo, lapho uthela ama-torrents akho, isenzo sikahulumeni esikhuthazayo singabheka ukugeleza kwedatha okungenayo nokuphuma kwama-server e-VPN, futhi sithole ukuthi ungubani. Noma ungase uphumelele nje ngandlela thile. Kungenzeka sesivele senze, futhi sizokwenza futhi. Ngenhlanhla, izifundazwe azikhathali <em>kangako</em> ngokweba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text6"
msgstr "Isinqumo esisodwa sokwenza iphrojekthi ngayinye, ukuthi uyishicilela yini usebenzisa igama elifanayo njengakuqala, noma cha. Uma uqhubeka usebenzisa igama elifanayo, khona-ke amaphutha ekuphepheni kokusebenza kusuka kumaphrojekthi angaphambilini angabuyela kuwe. Kodwa ukushicilela ngaphansi kwamagama ahlukene kusho ukuthi awakhi idumela elihlala isikhathi eside. Sikhethe ukuba nokuphepha okuqinile kokusebenza kusukela ekuqaleni ukuze siqhubeke sisebenzisa igama elifanayo, kodwa ngeke siqikeke ukushicilela ngaphansi kwegama elihlukile uma senze iphutha noma uma izimo zidinga lokho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text7"
msgstr "Ukuthola izwi kungaba yinkinga. Njengoba sishilo, lokhu kuseyindawo encane. Siqale sathumela ku-Reddit, kodwa sathola impumelelo ku-Hacker News. Okwamanje iseluleko sethu ukuthumela ezindaweni ezimbalwa bese ubona ukuthi kwenzekani. Futhi futhi, xhumana nathi. Sifisa ukusabalalisa izwi lemizamo eminingi yokugcina izinqolobane zabaphangi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion"
msgstr "Isiphetho"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Sithemba ukuthi lokhu kuyasiza kubagcini bezinqolobane zabaphangi abasanda kuqala. Siyajabula ukukwamukela kuleli zwe, ngakho-ke unganqikazi ukuxhumana. Ake sigcine ulwazi namasiko omhlaba ngangokunokwenzeka, futhi sikopishe kude nakude."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s> Reddit </a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.title"
msgstr "Sethula i-Pirate Library Mirror: Ukugcina ama-7TB ezincwadi (ezingekho ku-Libgen)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text1"
msgstr "Le phrojekthi (EDIT: ithuthelwe ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>) ihlose ukufaka isandla ekugcinweni nasekukhululweni kolwazi lwesintu. Senza umnikelo wethu omncane futhi othobekile, ezinyathelweni zabakhulu abaphambi kwethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text2"
msgstr "Ukugxila kwaleli phrojekthi kuboniswa igama lalo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.pirate"
msgstr "<strong>Umphangi</strong> - Siphula umthetho we-copyright ngamabomu emazweni amaningi. Lokhu kusivumela ukuthi senze okuthile izikhungo ezisemthethweni ezingakwazi ukukwenza: ukuqinisekisa ukuthi izincwadi zifakwa izibuko kude nakude."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.library"
msgstr "<strong>Umtapo</strong> - Njengemithapo eminingi, sigxila kakhulu ezintweni ezibhaliwe ezifana nezincwadi. Singase sandise kwezinye izinhlobo zemidiya esikhathini esizayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.mirror"
msgstr "<strong>Isibuko</strong> - Siyisibuko esiqinile semitapo yolwazi ekhona. Sigxila ekugcineni, hhayi ekwenzeni izincwadi zitholakale kalula futhi zilandwe (ukufinyelela) noma ekukhuthazeni umphakathi omkhulu wabantu abahlinzeka ngezincwadi ezintsha (ukuthola)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text3"
msgstr "Umtapo wokuqala esiwulingisile yi-Z-Library. Lona umtapo wezincwadi odumile (futhi ongekho emthethweni). Bathathe iqoqo le-Library Genesis balenza libe lula ukulisesha. Ngaphezu kwalokho, baye baba ngempumelelo kakhulu ekutholeni izincwadi ezintsha, ngokukhuthaza abasebenzisi abanikela ngezinsiza ezihlukahlukene. Njengamanje abanikeli lezi zincwadi ezintsha ku-Library Genesis. Futhi ngokungafani ne-Library Genesis, abenzi iqoqo labo libe lula ukulingiswa, okuvimbela ukugcinwa okubanzi. Lokhu kubalulekile kumodeli yabo yebhizinisi, njengoba bekhokhisa imali yokufinyelela iqoqo labo ngobuningi (ngaphezu kwezincwadi eziyi-10 ngosuku)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text4"
msgstr "Asenzi izinqumo zokuziphatha mayelana nokukhokhisa imali yokufinyelela ngobuningi eqoqweni lezincwadi ezingekho emthethweni. Akungabazeki ukuthi i-Z-Library ibe yimpumelelo ekwandiseni ukufinyelela kolwazi, nasekutholeni izincwadi eziningi. Silapha nje ukwenza ingxenye yethu: ukuqinisekisa ukugcinwa kwesikhathi eside kwalesi siqoqo esizimele."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text5"
msgstr "Sifuna ukukumema ukuthi usize ukugcina nokukhulula ulwazi lwesintu ngokulanda nokuhlanyela ama-torrents ethu. Bheka ikhasi lephrojekthi ukuze uthole ulwazi olwengeziwe mayelana nokuthi idatha ihlelwe kanjani."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text6"
msgstr "Siphinde sikumeme kakhulu ukuthi unikele ngemibono yakho yokuthi yiziphi iziqoqo okufanele zililingiswe ngokulandelayo, nokuthi ungayenza kanjani. Ndawonye singafeza okuningi. Lokhu kungumnikelo omncane phakathi kwezinye eziningi. Siyabonga, ngakho konke okwenzayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s> Reddit </a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.footnote"
msgstr "<em>Asixhumanisi namafayela kule bhulogi. Sicela uzitholele wena.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.title"
msgstr "I-ISBNdb dump, noma Zingaki Izincwadi Ezilondolozwe Phakade?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.tldr"
msgstr "Uma besizokhipha kahle amafayela emitatsheni yezincwadi emthunzini, siphi isibalo sezincwadi emhlabeni wonke esesilondolozile?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text1"
msgstr "Nge-Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: moved to <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>), inhloso yethu ukuthatha zonke izincwadi emhlabeni, sizilondoloze phakade.<sup>1</sup> Phakathi kwama-torrents ethu e-Z-Library, nama-torrents asekuqaleni e-Library Genesis, sinamafayela angu-11,783,153. Kodwa zingaki lezo, ngempela? Uma besikhipha kahle lawo mafayela, siphi isibalo sezincwadi emhlabeni wonke esesilondolozile? Sifuna ngempela ukuba nento efana nalena:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.10%"
msgstr "10% of ilifa elibhaliwe lesintu elilondolozwe phakade"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text2"
msgstr "Ngokwephesenti, sidinga isihlukanisi: inani eliphelele lezincwadi ezake zashicilelwa.<sup>2</sup> Ngaphambi kokuphela kwe-Google Books, unjiniyela kule phrojekthi, u-Leonid Taycher, <a %(booksearch_blogspot)s>wazama ukubala</a> leli nani. Wafika — ngokuhlekisa — ku-129,864,880 (“okungenani kuze kube ngeSonto”). Walibala leli nani ngokwakha isizindalwazi esihlangene sazo zonke izincwadi emhlabeni. Kulokhu, wahlanganisa ama-datasets ahlukene wabe esewahlanganisa ngezindlela ezihlukahlukene."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text3"
msgstr "Njengesikhashana esisheshayo, kukhona omunye umuntu owayezama ukuqopha zonke izincwadi emhlabeni: u-Aaron Swartz, isishoshovu sedijithali esingasekho kanye nomsunguli we-Reddit.<sup>3</sup> Waqala i-<a %(youtube)s>Open Library</a> ngenhloso ye-“ikhasi lewebhu elilodwa lenye incwadi ngayinye eshicilelwe”, ehlanganisa idatha evela emithonjeni eminingi ehlukene. Wagcina ekhokha inani eliphezulu ngomsebenzi wakhe wokulondoloza idijithali lapho ebhekene necala lokulanda izihloko zesayensi ngobuningi, okuholele ekuzibulaleni kwakhe. Akudingeki ukusho, lokhu kungenye yezizathu iqembu lethu elisebenzisa amagama angamanga, futhi kungani siqaphela kakhulu. I-Open Library isaqhutshwa ngokumangalisayo ngabantu e-Internet Archive, iqhubeka nefa lika-Aaron. Sizobuyela kulokhu kamuva kulesi sikhala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text4"
msgstr "Kumsebenzi we-Google blog, u-Taycher uchaza ezinye zezinselele zokulinganisa le nombolo. Okokuqala, yini eyenza incwadi? Kukhona izincazelo ezimbalwa ezingaba khona:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.copies"
msgstr "<strong>Izincwadi ezibonakalayo.</strong> Ngokusobala lokhu akusizi kakhulu, njengoba kuyizinkomba eziphindaphindwayo zezinto ezifanayo. Kungaba kuhle uma singagcina zonke izichasiselo abantu abenza ezincwadini, njengokubhala okudumile kukaFermat \"emaphethelweni\". Kodwa-ke, lokho kuzohlala kuyiphupho lomgcini wezincwadi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.works"
msgstr "<strong>“Imisebenzi”.</strong> Isibonelo “uHarry Potter kanye neChamber of Secrets” njengomqondo onengqondo, ohlanganisa zonke izinhlobo zawo, njengokuhumusha okuhlukile nokushicilelwa kabusha. Lokhu kuyincazelo ewusizo, kodwa kungaba nzima ukudweba umugqa wokuthi yini efanele ukubalwa. Isibonelo, mhlawumbe sifuna ukugcina ukuhumusha okuhlukile, nakuba ukushicilelwa kabusha okunezinguquko ezincane kungase kungabalulekile kangako."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.editions"
msgstr "<strong>“Izinguqulo”.</strong> Lapha ubala yonke inguqulo eyingqayizivele yencwadi. Uma kukhona okwehlukile ngayo, njengokuhlukile kwesembozo noma isandulelo esihlukile, kubalwa njengenye inguqulo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.files"
msgstr "<strong>Amafayela.</strong> Uma usebenza nezincwadi ezimnyama ezifana neLibrary Genesis, Sci-Hub, noma i-Z-Library, kunesinye isici okufanele sicatshangelwe. Kungase kube nezithombe eziningi zenguqulo efanayo. Futhi abantu bangakha izinguqulo ezingcono zamafayela akhona, ngokuskena umbhalo usebenzisa i-OCR, noma ukulungisa amakhasi abeskenwe ngombono. Sifuna ukubala la mafayela njengenye inguqulo kuphela, okuzodinga i-metadata enhle, noma ukuhlanganiswa kusetshenziswa izilinganiso zokufana kwamadokhumenti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text5"
msgstr "“Izinguqulo” kubonakala kuyincazelo esebenzayo kakhulu yokuthi “izincwadi” ziyini. Ngokufanelekile, le ncazelo isetshenziswa futhi ekunikezeni izinombolo ze-ISBN ezihlukile. I-ISBN, noma i-International Standard Book Number, ivame ukusetshenziswa kwezentengiselwano zamazwe ngamazwe, njengoba ihlanganiswe nohlelo lwe-barcode lwamazwe ngamazwe (”International Article Number”). Uma ufuna ukuthengisa incwadi ezitolo, idinga i-barcode, ngakho uthola i-ISBN."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text6"
msgstr "Okuthunyelwe kwebhulogi kaTaycher kukhuluma ngokuthi nakuba ama-ISBN ewusizo, awawona wonke, njengoba amukelwa ngempela kuphela maphakathi nawo-1970, futhi hhayi yonke indawo emhlabeni. Nokho, i-ISBN mhlawumbe iyisikhombi esisetshenziswa kakhulu sezinguqulo zezincwadi, ngakho-ke kuyisiqalo sethu esihle kakhulu. Uma singathola wonke ama-ISBN emhlabeni, sithola uhlu oluwusizo lwezincwadi ezisadinga ukugcinwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text7"
msgstr "Ngakho-ke, sithola kuphi idatha? Kukhona imizamo eminingana ekhona ezama ukuhlanganisa uhlu lwazo zonke izincwadi emhlabeni:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.google"
msgstr "<strong>Google.</strong> Ekugcineni, benza lolu cwaningo lwe-Google Books. Nokho, i-metadata yabo ayitholakali ngobuningi futhi kunzima ukuyikhipha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.openlib"
msgstr "<strong>Open Library.</strong> Njengoba kushiwo ngaphambili, lokhu kuyinjongo yabo yonke. Bahlinzeke ngemininingwane emikhulu yolwazi lwemithombo evela emitatsheni yolwazi esebenzisana nabo kanye nezinqolobane zikazwelonke, futhi baqhubeka nokwenza njalo. Banononina abavolontiya kanye nethimba lobuchwepheshe elizama ukuhlanganisa amarekhodi, futhi libanikeze zonke izinhlobo ze-metadata. Okungcono kakhulu, i-dataset yabo ivulekile ngokuphelele. Ungayilanda kalula <a %(openlibrary)s>lapha</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.worldcat"
msgstr "<strong>WorldCat.</strong> Leli yiwebhusayithi ephethwe yi-OCLC engenzi nzuzo, ethengisa izinhlelo zokuphatha imitapo yolwazi. Bahlanganisa i-metadata yezincwadi ezivela emitatsheni yolwazi eminingi, futhi bayenza itholakale ngewebhusayithi ye-WorldCat. Nokho, benza imali ngokuthengisa le datha, ngakho-ke ayitholakali ngokulanda ngobuningi. Baneminye i-datasets emincane etholakalayo yokulanda ngobuningi, ngokubambisana nemitapo yolwazi ethile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.isbndb"
msgstr "<strong>ISBNdb.</strong> Lona yisihloko salokhu okuthunyelwe kwebhulogi. I-ISBNdb ikhipha amawebhusayithi ahlukahlukene ukuze athole i-metadata yezincwadi, ikakhulukazi idatha yamanani, abayithengisa kubathengisi bezincwadi, ukuze bakwazi ukubeka amanani ezincwadi zabo ngokuhambisana nemakethe. Njengoba ama-ISBN esevamile namuhla, bakhe ngempumelelo \"ikhasi lewebhu lenye incwadi\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.ils"
msgstr "<strong>Izinhlelo ezihlukahlukene zemitapo yolwazi kanye nezinqolobane.</strong> Kukhona imitapo yolwazi nezinqolobane ezingakahlaziywa futhi zihlanganiswe yinoma iyiphi yalezi ezingenhla, ngokuvamile ngenxa yokuthi azinayo imali eyanele, noma ngezinye izizathu azifuni ukwabelana ngedatha yazo ne-Open Library, OCLC, Google, njalonjalo. Eziningi zalezi zineziqopha-mlando zedijithali ezitholakala nge-inthanethi, futhi zivame ukungavikeleki kahle, ngakho uma ufuna ukusiza futhi ujabulele ukufunda ngezinhlelo zemitapo yolwazi ezingajwayelekile, lezi zindawo ziqala kahle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text8"
msgstr "Kulesi sikhala, siyajabula ukumemezela ukukhishwa okuncane (uma kuqhathaniswa nokukhishwa kwethu kwe-Z-Library kwangaphambilini). Sikhiphe iningi le-ISBNdb, futhi senze idatha itholakale ukuze ilandwe kuwebhusayithi ye-Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: ithuthelwe ku-<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>; asizukuyixhumanisa lapha ngqo, vele uyifune). Lezi zirekhodi ezingaba yizigidi ezingama-30.9 (20GB njenge-<a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a>; 4.4GB igcwele). Kuwebhusayithi yabo bathi empeleni banerekhodi ezingama-32.6 million, ngakho-ke kungenzeka ukuthi sithole okuthile, noma <em>bona</em> benza okuthile okungalungile. Noma kunjalo, okwamanje ngeke sabelane ngokuthi sikwenze kanjani — sizokushiya njengomsebenzi womfundi. ;-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text9"
msgstr "Esizokwabelana ngakho ukuhlaziywa kokuqala, ukuzama ukusondela ekubaleni inani lezincwadi emhlabeni. Sibheke ama-datasets amathathu: le dataset entsha ye-ISBNdb, ukukhishwa kwethu kokuqala kwe-metadata esiyikopishe ku-Z-Library shadow library (ehlanganisa ne-Library Genesis), kanye ne-Open Library data dump."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text10"
msgstr "Ake siqale ngamanani alinganiselwe:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text11"
msgstr "Kuzo zombili i-Z-Library/Libgen ne-Open Library kunezincwadi eziningi kakhulu kune-ISBNs ezihlukile. Ingabe lokho kusho ukuthi izincwadi eziningi azinazo i-ISBNs, noma i-ISBN metadata ilahlekile nje? Singaphendula lo mbuzo ngokuhlanganisa ukuvumelanisa okuzenzakalelayo okusekelwe kwezinye izici (isihloko, umbhali, umshicileli, njll), ukuheha imithombo eminingi yedatha, nokukhipha i-ISBNs kuma-scans ezincwadi uqobo (esimweni se-Z-Library/Libgen)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text12"
msgstr "Mangaki kula ma-ISBNs ahlukile? Lokhu kuboniswa kahle nge-Venn diagram:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text13"
msgstr "Ukuze sibe nokuqonda okungcono:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text14"
msgstr "Sasithukile ukuthi kunokuhlangana okuncane kangaka! I-ISBNdb inenani elikhulu lama-ISBN angaveli ku-Z-Library noma ku-Open Library, futhi okufanayo kuyenzeka (ngokwezinga elincane kodwa elibalulekile) kwezinye ezimbili. Lokhu kuvusa imibuzo eminingi emisha. Ukufanisa okuzenzakalelayo kungasiza kangakanani ekubekeni amalebula ezincwadi ezingazange zifakwe ama-ISBN? Ngabe kuzoba nokufanisa okuningi futhi ngaleyo ndlela kube nokuhlangana okwengeziwe? Futhi, kuzokwenzekani uma siletha i-dataset yesi-4 noma yesi-5? Sizobona ukuhlanganiswa okungakanani ngaleso sikhathi?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text15"
msgstr "Lokhu kusinika iphuzu lokuqala. Manje singabheka wonke ama-ISBN angazange abe ku-dataset ye-Z-Library, futhi angafani nezinkambu zesihloko/umbhali. Lokho kungasinika indlela yokugcina zonke izincwadi emhlabeni: okokuqala ngokuklwebha i-inthanethi ukuze sithole izithombe, bese siphuma empilweni yangempela ukuze sithole izincwadi. Lokhu kungase kusekelwe ngumphakathi, noma kuqhutshwe “ngemiklomelo” evela kubantu abafisa ukubona izincwadi ezithile ziguqulwa zibe yidijithali. Konke lokho kuyindaba yesikhathi esihlukile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text16"
msgstr "Uma ufuna ukusiza nganoma yini kulokhu — ukuhlaziya okwengeziwe; ukuklwebha i-metadata eyengeziwe; ukuthola izincwadi eziningi; i-OCR yezincwadi; ukwenza lokhu kwezinye izizinda (isb. amaphepha, izincwadi ezilalelwayo, amafilimu, izinhlelo zethelevishini, omagazini) noma ngisho nokwenza le datha itholakale ezintweni ezifana nokuqeqeshwa kwe-ML / imodeli yolimi enkulu — sicela uxhumane nami (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text17"
msgstr "Uma unentshisekelo ekutheni ukuhlaziya idatha, sisebenza ekwenzeni ama-datasets ethu nezikripthi zitholakale ngendlela elula yokusebenzisa. Kuzoba kuhle uma ungavele uthathe i-notebook bese uqala ukudlala ngalokhu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text18"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, uma ufuna ukusekela lo msebenzi, sicela ucabangele ukwenza umnikelo. Lokhu kuyisikhungo esiqhutshwa ngokuphelele ngabavolontiya, futhi umnikelo wakho wenza umehluko omkhulu. Yonke into iyasiza. Okwamanje sithatha iminikelo nge-crypto; bheka ikhasi le-Donate ku-Archive ka-Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s> Reddit </a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn1"
msgstr "1. Ngencazelo ethile enengqondo ye-\"phakade\". ;)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn2"
msgstr "2. Vele, ifa elibhaliwe lesintu lingaphezu kwezincwadi, ikakhulukazi kulezi zinsuku. Ngenxa yalokhu okuthunyelwe kanye nokukhishwa kwethu kwakamuva sigxile ezincwadini, kodwa izintshisekelo zethu zidlulela phambili."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn3"
msgstr "3. Kuningi okungashiwo ngo-Aaron Swartz, kodwa sifuna ukumkhuluma kafushane, njengoba edlala indima ebalulekile kule ndaba. Njengoba isikhathi sihamba, abantu abaningi bangase bahlangabezane negama lakhe okokuqala, futhi bangene emgodini we-rabbit ngokwabo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.title"
msgstr "Iwindi elibalulekile lamathala ezincwadi angaphansi komthunzi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.tldr"
msgstr "Singasho kanjani ukuthi sigcina amaqoqo ethu kuze kube phakade, lapho esesondela ku-1 PB?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.links"
msgstr "<a %(critical_window_chinese)s>Inguqulo yesiShayina 中文版</a>, xoxa ku-<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.text1"
msgstr "Ku-Archive ka-Anna, sivame ukubuzwa ukuthi singasho kanjani ukuthi sigcina amaqoqo ethu kuze kube phakade, lapho usayizi ophelele ususondela ku-1 Petabyte (1000 TB), futhi usakhula. Kulesi sihloko sizobheka ifilosofi yethu, futhi sibone ukuthi kungani ishumi leminyaka elizayo libalulekile emsebenzini wethu wokugcina ulwazi namasiko esintu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.fig1"
msgstr "<I-<a %(annas_archive_stats)s>usayizi ophelele</a> wamaqoqo ethu, ezinyangeni ezimbalwa ezedlule, uhlukaniswe ngenani labahlwanyeli be-torrent."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities"
msgstr "Izinto ezibalulekile"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text1"
msgstr "Kungani sinendaba kakhulu namaphepha nezincwadi? Ake sibeke eceleni inkolelo yethu eyisisekelo yokugcina ngokujwayelekile — singase sibhale okuthunyelwe okunye ngalokho. Ngakho-ke kungani amaphepha nezincwadi ngokukhethekile? Impendulo ilula: <strong>ukugcwala kolwazi</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text2"
msgstr "Ngemegabyte ngayinye yokugcina, umbhalo obhaliwe ugcina ulwazi oluningi kunazo zonke izindaba. Ngenkathi sinendaba ngolwazi namasiko, sinendaba kakhulu nolwazi. Sekukonke, sithola ukuhleleka kokugcwala kolwazi nokubaluleka kokugcina okubukeka cishe kanje:"

