#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text6"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, sinakekela isikali. Sinesikhathi nemali elinganiselwe, ngakho-ke singathanda ukuchitha inyanga sisindisa izincwadi eziyi-10,000 kunokuthi izincwadi eziyi-1,000 — uma zilingana ngokufanele futhi zisengozini."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib"
msgstr "Imitapo yolwazi emthunzini"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text1"
msgstr "Kunezinhlangano eziningi ezinemiqondo efanayo, nezinto ezibekwe phambili ezifanayo. Impela, kunezincwadi, izinqolobane, amalabhorethri, iminyuziyamu, nezinye izikhungo ezibhekele ukugcinwa kwalolu hlobo. Eziningi zalezi zikhungo zixhaswa kahle, nguhulumeni, ngabantu ngabanye, noma izinkampani. Kodwa zinephutha elikhulu elilodwa: uhlelo lwezomthetho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text2"
msgstr "Lapha kuvela indima eyingqayizivele yemitapo yolwazi emthunzini, nesizathu sokuba khona kwe-Anna’s Archive. Singenza izinto ezinye izikhungo ezingavunyelwe ukuzenza. Manje, akuvamile ukuthi sikwazi ukugcina izinto ezingekho emthethweni ukugcina kwenye indawo. Cha, kuvumelekile ezindaweni eziningi ukwakha inqolobane nanoma iziphi izincwadi, amaphepha, omagazini, njalonjalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text3"
msgstr "Kodwa lokho okushoda ngakho izinqolobane zomthetho kaningi ukungafani nokuhlala isikhathi eside. Kukhona izincwadi ezikhona kuphela ikhophi eyodwa ethile emtatsheni wezincwadi womzimba endaweni ethile. Kukhona amarekhodi e-metadata agcinwe yinkampani eyodwa. Kukhona amaphephandaba agcinwe kuphela ku-microfilm endaweni eyodwa. Imitapo yolwazi ingathola izimali ezinqunyelwe, izinkampani zingabhanga, izinqolobane zingaqhunyiswa nokuqothulwa phansi. Lokhu akuyona into ecatshangelwayo — lokhu kwenzeka ngaso sonke isikhathi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text4"
msgstr "Into esingayenza ngokukhethekile ku-Anna’s Archive ukugcina amakhophi amaningi emisebenzi, ngezinga elikhulu. Singaqoqa amaphepha, izincwadi, omagazini, nokunye, bese sikusabalalisa ngobuningi. Njengamanje sikwenza lokhu ngama-torrents, kodwa ubuchwepheshe obuqondile abubalulekile futhi buzoshintsha ngokuhamba kwesikhathi. Ingxenye ebalulekile ukuthola amakhophi amaningi asatshalaliswa emhlabeni wonke. Le misho evela eminyakeni engaphezu kwengu-200 edlule isalokhu iqiniso:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.quote.the-lost"
msgstr "<em><q>Okulahlekile akukwazi ukubuyiswa; kodwa masilondoloze lokho okusele: hhayi ngamavolthi nezikhiye ezibavimbela emehlweni omphakathi nasekusebenziseni, ngokubanikeza ekuchithweni kwesikhathi, kodwa ngokuphindaphindwa kwamakhophi, okuzobeka ngaphandle kokufinyelela engozini.</q></em><br>— Thomas Jefferson, 1791"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text5"
msgstr "Inothi elisheshayo mayelana nomphakathi. Njengoba i-Anna’s Archive igxile ngokukhethekile emisebenzini engavumelekile ezindaweni eziningi emhlabeni jikelele, asikhathazeki ngamaqoqo atholakala kabanzi, njengezincwadi zomphakathi. Izikhungo zomthetho zivame ukukunakekela kahle lokho. Nokho, kunezinto ezithile ezenza ukuthi kwesinye isikhathi sisebenze kumaqoqo atholakala emphakathini:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.metadata"
msgstr "Amarekhodi e-Metadata angabukwa mahhala kuwebhusayithi ye-Worldcat, kodwa awakwazi ukulandwa ngobuningi (kuze kube yilapho si<a %(worldcat_scrape)s>sikhipha</a> wona)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.github"
msgstr "Ikhodi ingaba umthombo ovulekile ku-Github, kodwa i-Github iyonke ayikwazi ukuboniswa kalula futhi ngaleyo ndlela igcinwe (nakuba kuleli cala elithile kukhona amakhophi asatshalaliswa ngokwanele ezinqolobaneni eziningi zekhodi)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.reddit"
msgstr "I-Reddit imahhala ukuyisebenzisa, kodwa muva nje ibeke izinyathelo eziqinile zokulwa nokukopela, ngenxa yokulamba kwedatha kwe-LLM (okuningi ngalokho kamuva)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies"
msgstr "Ukuphindaphindwa kwamakhophi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text1"
msgstr "Sibuyele embuzweni wethu wokuqala: singasho kanjani ukuthi sigcina amaqoqo ethu kuze kube phakade? Inkinga enkulu lapha ukuthi iqoqo lethu liye <a %(torrents_stats)s>landile</a> ngesivinini esikhulu, ngokukhipha nokuvula umthombo wamaqoqo amakhulu (ngaphezu komsebenzi omangalisayo osewenziwe ezinye izinqolobane zomthunzi wedatha evulekile njenge-Sci-Hub ne-Library Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text2"
msgstr "Lokhu kukhula kwedatha kwenza kube nzima ukuthi amaqoqo aboniswe emhlabeni wonke. Isitoreji sedatha sibiza kakhulu! Kodwa siyathemba, ikakhulukazi lapho sibuka lezi zindlela ezintathu ezilandelayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit"
msgstr "1. Siphule izithelo eziphansi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text1"
msgstr "Lokhu kulandela ngqo ezibalulweni zethu ezixoxwe ngenhla. Sithanda ukusebenza ekukhululeni amaqoqo amakhulu kuqala. Manje njengoba sesiqinisekise amanye amaqoqo amakhulu emhlabeni, silindele ukuthi ukukhula kwethu kube kancane kakhulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text2"
msgstr "Kusenezinsalela ezinde zamaqoqo amancane, futhi izincwadi ezintsha zihlolwa noma zishicilelwa nsuku zonke, kodwa izinga lizoba kancane kakhulu. Singase siphinde siphindwe kabili noma kathathu ngosayizi, kodwa esikhathini eside."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage"
msgstr "2. Izindleko zesitoreji ziyaqhubeka nokwehla ngokushesha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text1"
msgstr "Njengamanje, <a %(diskprices)s>amanani ediski</a> nge-TB azungeze u-$12 kumadiski amasha, $8 kumadiski asetshenzisiwe, no-$4 ku-tape. Uma singabheki ngokucophelela futhi sibheka kuphela amadiski amasha, lokho kusho ukuthi ukugcina i-petabyte kubiza cishe u-$12,000. Uma sicabanga ukuthi umtapo wethu wezincwadi uzophindeka kathathu kusuka ku-900TB kuya ku-2.7PB, lokho kuzoba u-$32,400 ukubonisa umtapo wethu wezincwadi wonke. Ukwengeza ugesi, izindleko zezinye izinsiza, nokunye, ake sikubeke ku-$40,000. Noma nge-tape kufana no-$15,000–$20,000."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text2"
msgstr "Ngakolunye uhlangothi <strong>$15,000–$40,000 isamba solwazi lwesintu lonke kuyintengo ephansi</strong>. Ngakolunye uhlangothi, kuyabiza ukulindela amakhophi agcwele amaningi, ikakhulukazi uma singathanda nalabo bantu ukuthi baqhubeke nokuhlwanyela ama-torrents abo ukuze kuzuze abanye."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text3"
msgstr "Lokho kungenzeka namuhla. Kodwa inqubekela phambili iyaqhubeka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text4"
msgstr "Izindleko zediski eziqinile nge-TB ziye zancishiswa cishe ngengxenye yesithathu eminyakeni eyi-10 edlule, futhi kungenzeka ziqhubeke nokwehla ngesivinini esifanayo. I-Tape ibonakala isendleleni efanayo. Amanani e-SSD ayawa ngokushesha okukhulu, futhi angathatha amanani e-HDD ekupheleni kweminyaka eyishumi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.hdd-prices"
msgstr "Izitayela zamanani e-HDD avela emithonjeni ehlukene (chofoza ukuze ubuke ucwaningo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text5"
msgstr "Uma lokhu kuqhubeka, khona-ke eminyakeni eyi-10 singase sibheke kuphela ku-$5,000–$13,000 ukubonisa iqoqo lethu lonke (1/3), noma ngisho nangaphansi uma sikhula kancane ngosayizi. Nakuba kusenani elikhulu lemali, lokhu kuzofinyeleleka kubantu abaningi. Futhi kungase kube ngcono kakhulu ngenxa yendaba elandelayo…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density"
msgstr "3. Ukuthuthukiswa kokugcwala kolwazi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text1"
msgstr "Njengamanje sigcina izincwadi ngezinhlobo ezimsulwa ezisinikezwa zona. Yebo, ziyacindezelwa, kodwa kaningi zisengamaskani amakhulu noma izithombe zamakhasi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text2"
msgstr "Kuze kube manje, izinketho zokunciphisa usayizi ophelele wokuqoqwa kwethu kube ngokucindezela okukhulu, noma ukususwa kokuphindaphinda. Nokho, ukuze uthole ukonga okukhulu, kokubili kulahleka kakhulu ngokuthanda kwethu. Ukucindezela okukhulu kwezithombe kungenza umbhalo ungafundeki kahle. Futhi ukususwa kokuphindaphinda kudinga ukuzethemba okuphezulu kwezincwadi ezifanayo, okungavamile ukuba kunembile, ikakhulukazi uma okuqukethwe kufana kodwa izithombe zithathwe ngezikhathi ezihlukene."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text3"
msgstr "Kube khona njalo inketho yesithathu, kodwa ikhwalithi yayo ibingesihle kangangokuthi asikaze siyicabangele: <strong>OCR, noma Optical Character Recognition</strong>. Lokhu kuyinqubo yokuguqula izithombe zibe umbhalo omsulwa, ngokusebenzisa i-AI ukuthola izinhlamvu ezithombeni. Amathuluzi alokhu abekhona isikhathi eside, futhi abesemazingeni amahle, kodwa \"amazinga amahle\" awanele ngezinjongo zokulondoloza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text4"
msgstr "Nokho, amamodeli amasha wokufunda okujulile kwe-multi-modal enze inqubekela phambili esheshayo kakhulu, nakuba kusabiza kakhulu. Silindele ukuthi kokubili ukunemba nezindleko kuthuthuke kakhulu eminyakeni ezayo, kuze kube seqophelweni lapho kuzoba ngokoqobo ukusebenzisa kulo lonke ulwazi lwethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.ocr"
msgstr "Ukuthuthukiswa kwe-OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text5"
msgstr "Uma lokho kwenzeka, cishe sizogcina amafayela okuqala, kodwa ngaphezu kwalokho singaba nenguqulo encane kakhulu yolwazi lwethu abantu abaningi abazofuna ukuyilingisa. Iphuzu elibalulekile ukuthi umbhalo omsulwa uqobo uyacindezelwa kangcono, futhi kulula kakhulu ukususa ukuphindaphinda, okusinika ukonga okwengeziwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text6"
msgstr "Sekukonke akuyona into engokoqobo ukulindela ukuncipha okungenani okungu-5-10x ngosayizi wefayela ophelele, mhlawumbe ngisho nangaphezulu. Ngisho nokuncipha okungu-5x okungatheni, sizobheka <strong>$1,000–$3,000 eminyakeni eyi-10 ngisho noma ulwazi lwethu luphindwe kathathu ngosayizi</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window"
msgstr "Iwindi elibalulekile"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text1"
msgstr "Uma lezi zibikezelo zinembile, <strong>sidinga nje ukulinda iminyaka embalwa</strong> ngaphambi kokuba lonke ulwazi lwethu lulingiswe kabanzi. Ngakho-ke, ngamazwi kaThomas Jefferson, \"kubekwe ngaphandle kokufinyelela kwengozi.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text2"
msgstr "Ngeshwa, ukuvela kwe-LLM, nokufunwa kwedatha kwazo, kubeke abaningi abaphethe amalungelo obunikazi ekuzivikeleni. Ngisho nangaphezulu kunalokho abebekade benjalo. Amawebhusayithi amaningi enza kube nzima ukukopela nokulondoloza, amacala ayaphaphalaza, kanti ngaleso sikhathi izincwadi zomzimba nezinqolobane ziyaqhubeka nokunganakwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text3"
msgstr "Singalindela kuphela ukuthi lezi zindlela ziqhubeke nokuba zimbi kakhulu, futhi imisebenzi eminingi ilahleke ngaphambi kokuba ingene esidlangalaleni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text4"
msgstr "<strong>Sisendaweni yokuvukela ekulondolozeni, kodwa <q>okulahlekile akukwazi ukubuyiswa.</q></strong> Sinomkhawulo obalulekile weminyaka eyi-5-10 lapho kusabiza kakhulu ukusebenza ulwazi olufihliwe nokudala izibuko eziningi emhlabeni wonke, futhi lapho ukufinyelela kungakavaliwe ngokuphelele."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text5"
msgstr "Uma singakwazi ukuwela leli windi, sizobe silondoloze ulwazi namasiko esintu kuze kube phakade. Akufanele sivumele lesi sikhathi sichitheke. Akufanele sivumele leli windi elibalulekile livaleke kithi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text6"
msgstr "Asihambe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.title"
msgstr "Ukufinyelela okukhethekile kwezinkampani ze-LLM eqoqweni lezincwadi ezingezona ezenganekwane ezinkulu kunazo zonke emhlabeni"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.subtitle"
msgstr "<a %(duxiu_exclusive_chinese)s>Inguqulo yesiShayina 中文版</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Xoxa ku-Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> I-Anna’s Archive ithole iqoqo eliyingqayizivele lezincwadi ezingezona ezenganekwane zesiShayina ezingu-7.5 million / 350TB — elikhulu kune-Library Genesis. Silungele ukunikeza inkampani ye-LLM ukufinyelela okukhethekile, ngokushintshanisa nge-OCR esezingeni eliphezulu nokukhishwa kombhalo.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text1"
msgstr "Lokhu okuthunyelwe kwebhulogi okufushane. Sifuna inkampani noma isikhungo esizosisiza nge-OCR nokukhishwa kombhalo eqoqweni elikhulu esilitholile, ngokushintshanisa ngokufinyelela okukhethekile kwangaphambi kwesikhathi. Ngemuva kwesikhathi sokuvinjelwa, sizokhipha iqoqo lonke."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text2"
msgstr "Umbhalo wezinga eliphezulu wezifundo ulusizo olukhulu ekuqeqesheni ama-LLM. Nakuba iqoqo lethu lingesiShayina, lokhu kufanele kube usizo ngisho nasekuqeqesheni ama-LLM esiNgisi: amamodeli abonakala ehlanganisa imiqondo nolwazi kungakhathalekile ulimi lwemvelaphi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text3"
msgstr "Kulokhu, umbhalo udinga ukukhipha kusuka kuzithombe. Yini u-Anna’s Archive ayitholayo kulokhu? Ukusesha umbhalo ogcwele wezincwadi kubasebenzisi bayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text4"
msgstr "Ngoba izinhloso zethu zihambisana nalezo zabathuthukisi be-LLM, sifuna ukubambisana. Sizimisele ukukunikeza <strong>ukufinyelela okukhethekile kusenesikhathi kuleli qoqo ngobuningi unyaka owodwa</strong>, uma ungakwazi ukwenza i-OCR efanele nokukhipha umbhalo. Uma uzimisele ukwabelana nathi ngekhodi yonke yephayiphi yakho, sizimisele ukuvimba iqoqo isikhathi eside."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages"
msgstr "Amakhasi esibonelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text1"
msgstr "Ukuze usibonise ukuthi unepayiphi elihle, nansi amakhasi ambalwa esibonelo okuqala ngawo, avela encwadini nge-superconductors. Iphayiphi yakho kufanele iphathe kahle izibalo, amatafula, amashadi, izinyathelo zaphansi, njalonjalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text2"
msgstr "Thumela amakhasi akho asebenziwe ku-imeyili yethu. Uma ebukeka kahle, sizokuthumelela okwengeziwe ngasese, futhi silindele ukuthi ukwazi ukuqhuba iphayi yakho ngokushesha nakulawo. Uma sesaneliseka, singenza isivumelwano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection"
msgstr "Iqoqo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text1"
msgstr "Olunye ulwazi mayelana neqoqo. <a %(duxiu)s>Duxiu</a> iyisisekelo sedatha esikhulu sezincwadi eziskeniwe, esidalwe yi-<a %(chaoxing)s>SuperStar Digital Library Group</a>. Iningi lezincwadi ziyizincwadi zesayensi, eziskeniwe ukuze zenzelwe ukuthi zitholakale ngedijithali ezikhungweni zemfundo ephakeme nasemitatsheni yezincwadi. Kubabukeli bethu abakhuluma isiNgisi, <a %(library_princeton)s>Princeton</a> kanye ne-<a %(guides_lib_uw)s>University of Washington</a> banemininingwane emihle. Kukhona futhi isihloko esihle esinikeza isizinda esengeziwe: <a %(doi)s>“Digitizing Chinese Books: A Case Study of the SuperStar DuXiu Scholar Search Engine”</a> (bheka ku-Anna’s Archive)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text2"
msgstr "Izincwadi ezivela ku-Duxiu ziye zaphangwa isikhathi eside ku-inthanethi yaseShayina. Imvamisa zithengiswa ngaphezu kwedola elilodwa ngabathengisi. Zivame ukusatshalaliswa kusetshenziswa okulingana ne-Google Drive yaseShayina, okuvame ukuhlaselwa ukuze kuvunyelwe isikhala esengeziwe sokugcina. Eminye imininingwane yezobuchwepheshe ingatholakala <a %(github_duty_machine)s>lapha</a> kanye <a %(github_821_github_io)s>lapha</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text3"
msgstr "Nakuba izincwadi ziye zasatshalaliswa ngokungemthetho, kunzima kakhulu ukuzithola ngobuningi. Sibe nalesi siphetho phezulu ohlwini lwethu lwezinto okufanele zenziwe, futhi sanikezela izinyanga eziningi zomsebenzi wesikhathi esigcwele kulokhu. Nokho, muva nje, isisebenzi esingakholeki, esimangalisayo, nesinethalente sithintekile nathi, sathi senze wonke lo msebenzi kakade — ngezindleko ezinkulu. Basabelane nathi ngalo lonke iqoqo, ngaphandle kokulindela lutho emuva, ngaphandle kokuqinisekisa ukugcinwa kwesikhathi eside. Kuyamangalisa ngempela. Bavumile ukucela usizo ngale ndlela ukuze iqoqo lethu lenziwe i-OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text4"
msgstr "Iqoqo liqukethe amafayela angu-7,543,702. Lokhu kudlula i-Library Genesis non-fiction (cishe izigidi ezi-5.3). Usayizi wefayela eliphelele cishe u-359TB (326TiB) ngendlela yalo yamanje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text5"
msgstr "Sivulekele ezinye iziphakamiso nemibono. Xhumana nathi nje. Bheka ku-Anna’s Archive ukuthola ulwazi olwengeziwe mayelana namaqoqo ethu, imizamo yokugcinwa, nokuthi ungasisiza kanjani. Siyabonga!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.signoff"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Isixwayiso: le bhulogi isiyekile ukusebenza. Sinqume ukuthi i-IPFS ayikalungi okwamanje. Sisazoxhumanisa namafayela ku-IPFS kusuka ku-Anna’s Archive uma kungenzeka, kodwa asisazosingatha thina uqobo, futhi asisabeki ukuthi abanye basebenzise i-IPFS. Sicela ubheke ikhasi lethu le-Torrents uma ufuna ukusiza ukugcina iqoqo lethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Siza ukusabalalisa i-Z-Library ku-IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.title"
msgstr "Indlela yokusebenzisa umtapo wolwazi omnyama: ukusebenza ku-Anna’s Archive"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tldr"
msgstr "Ayikho <q>i-AWS yezinhlangano zomusa ezimnyama,</q> ngakho-ke siyisebenzisa kanjani i-Anna’s Archive?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text1"
msgstr "Ngisebenzisa <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, injini yokusesha enkulu kunazo zonke emhlabeni evulekile engenzi nzuzo yezincwadi ezimnyama, njenge-Sci-Hub, i-Library Genesis, ne-Z-Library. Inhloso yethu ukwenza ulwazi namasiko kutholakale kalula, futhi ekugcineni sakhe umphakathi wabantu abahlanganisa ndawonye ukugcinwa kwezincwadi <a %(blog_isbndb_dump_how_many_books_are_preserved_forever)s>zonke izincwadi emhlabeni</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text2"
msgstr "Kulesi sihloko ngizokukhombisa ukuthi sisebenzisa kanjani le webhusayithi, nezinkinga ezihlukile eziza nokusebenza kwewebhusayithi enesimo esingaqinisekile ngokomthetho, njengoba kungekho “AWS yezinhlangano zomusa ezimnyama”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text3"
msgstr "<em>Futhi hlola isihloko esihlobene <a %(blog_how_to_become_a_pirate_archivist)s>Indlela yokuba umgcini wezincwadi omnyama</a>.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens"
msgstr "Amathokheni entsha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text1"
msgstr "Ake siqale ngesakhiwo sethu sobuchwepheshe. Sihloselwe ukuba sibonakale singenamahloni. Sisebenzisa i-Flask, i-MariaDB, ne-ElasticSearch. Lokho kuphela. Ukusesha kuyinkinga eselungisiwe kakhulu, futhi asihlosile ukuyiphinda. Ngaphezu kwalokho, kufanele sichithe <a %(mcfunley)s>amathokheni ethu entsha</a> kwenye into: ukungasuswa ngabezomthetho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text2"
msgstr "Ngakho-ke i-Anna’s Archive ilungile noma ayilungile kangakanani? Lokhu kuncike kakhulu emthethweni wezwe. Amazwe amaningi akholelwa kuhlobo oluthile lwe-copyright, okusho ukuthi abantu noma izinkampani zinikezwa ilungelo elikhethekile lokuba ne-monopoly ethile yemisebenzi ethile isikhathi esithile. Njengokuphawula, e-Anna’s Archive sikholelwa ukuthi nakuba kunezinzuzo ezithile, i-copyright iyonke iyinkinga enkulu emphakathini — kodwa lokho kuyindaba yesinye isikhathi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text3"
msgstr "Le monopoly ekhethekile emisebenzini ethile isho ukuthi akuvumelekile kunoma ubani ngaphandle kwale monopoly ukusabalalisa ngqo le misebenzi — kufaka phakathi nathi. Kodwa i-Anna’s Archive iyinjini yokusesha engasabalalisi ngqo le misebenzi (okungenani hhayi kuwebhusayithi yethu ecacile), ngakho-ke kufanele sibe sesimweni esihle, akunjalo? Akunjalo. Ezindaweni eziningi akuvumelekile nje kuphela ukusabalalisa imisebenzi enelungelo lobunikazi, kodwa futhi ukuxhumanisa nezindawo ezenza lokho. Isibonelo esidumile salokhu umthetho we-DMCA wase-United States."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text4"
msgstr "Lokho ukuphela okuqinile kwe-spectrum. Ngakolunye uhlangothi lwe-spectrum kungaba khona amazwe angenawo nhlobo imithetho ye-copyright, kodwa la awukho ngempela. Cishe wonke amazwe anohlobo oluthile lomthetho we-copyright. Ukuphoqelela kuyindaba ehlukile. Kunamazwe amaningi anohulumeni abangakhathaleli ukuphoqelela umthetho we-copyright. Kukhona futhi amazwe aphakathi kwezinhlangothi ezimbili, avimbela ukusabalalisa imisebenzi enelungelo lobunikazi, kodwa angavimbeli ukuxhumanisa naleyo misebenzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text5"
msgstr "Okunye okucatshangelwayo kusezingeni lenkampani. Uma inkampani isebenza endaweni engakhathaleli i-copyright, kodwa inkampani ngokwayo ingafuni ukuthatha noma yisiphi isisulu, khona-ke bangase bavale iwebhusayithi yakho ngokushesha nje lapho othile ekhononda ngayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text6"
msgstr "Ekugcineni, okunye okucatshangelwayo okukhulu izinkokhelo. Njengoba sidinga ukuhlala singaziwa, asikwazi ukusebenzisa izindlela zokukhokha ezivamile. Lokhu kusishiya ne-cryptocurrencies, futhi yisibalo esincane nje sezinkampani ezisekela lezo (kukhona amakhadi esikweletu angokoqobo akhokhelwa nge-crypto, kodwa avame ukungamukelwa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture"
msgstr "Isakhiwo sohlelo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text1"
msgstr "Ngakho-ke ake sithi uthole izinkampani ezizimisele ukusingatha iwebhusayithi yakho ngaphandle kokukuvimba — ake sizibize ngokuthi “abahlinzeki abathanda inkululeko” 😄. Uzothola ngokushesha ukuthi ukusingatha konke nabo kubiza kakhulu, ngakho-ke ungase ufune ukuthola “abahlinzeki abashibhile” bese wenza ukusingatha kwangempela lapho, ngokusebenzisa abahlinzeki abathanda inkululeko. Uma wenza kahle, abahlinzeki abashibhile ngeke bazi ukuthi yini oyisingathayo, futhi ngeke bathole izikhalazo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text2"
msgstr "Ngabo bonke laba bahlinzeki kunengozi yokuthi bangakuvimba noma kunjalo, ngakho-ke udinga nokuphindaphinda. Sidinga lokhu kuzo zonke izigaba zesakhiwo sethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text3"
msgstr "Inkampani ethile ethanda inkululeko ebeke isikhundla esithakazelisayo i-Cloudflare. Baphikise ukuthi abahlinzeki bokusingatha, kodwa bayinsiza, njengomphakeli we-ISP. Ngakho-ke abaphansi kwe-DMCA noma ezinye izicelo zokususwa, futhi badlulisela noma yiziphi izicelo kumhlinzeki wakho wokusingatha wangempela. Baze baya enkantolo ukuvikela lesi sakhiwo. Ngakho-ke singabasebenzisa njengesinye isendlalelo sokugcina nokuvikela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text4"
msgstr "I-Cloudflare ayemukeli izinkokhelo ezingaziwa, ngakho-ke singasebenzisa kuphela uhlelo lwayo lwamahhala. Lokhu kusho ukuthi asikwazi ukusebenzisa izici zabo zokulinganisa umthwalo noma zokwehluleka. Ngakho-ke <a %(annas_archive_l255)s>sikwenze lokhu thina uqobo</a> ezingeni lesizinda. Uma ikhasi lilayisha, isiphequluli sizohlola ukuthi isizinda samanje sisatholakala yini, futhi uma kungenjalo, sizobhala kabusha wonke ama-URL esizindeni esihlukile. Njengoba i-Cloudflare igcina amakhasi amaningi, lokhu kusho ukuthi umsebenzisi angafika kusizinda sethu esikhulu, noma ngabe iseva ye-proxy iphansi, bese ngokuchofoza okulandelayo adluliselwe kwesinye isizinda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text5"
msgstr "Sisenezinkinga zokusebenza ezijwayelekile okufanele sibhekane nazo, njengokuqapha impilo yeseva, ukubhalisa amaphutha angemuva nangaphambili, njalonjalo. Isakhiwo sethu sokwehluleka sivumela ukuqina okwengeziwe kulolu hlangothi futhi, ngokwesibonelo ngokusebenzisa isethi ehlukile ngokuphelele yama-server kwesinye sezizinda. Singasebenzisa ngisho nezinguqulo ezindala zekhodi nama-datasets kulesi sizinda esihlukile, uma kwenzeka iphutha elibucayi enguqulweni enkulu lingabonwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text6"
msgstr "Singaphinde sizivikele uma i-Cloudflare iphendukela kithi, ngokuyisusa kwesinye sezizinda, njengalesi sizinda esihlukile. Ukuhlanganiswa okuhlukile kwale mibono kungenzeka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools"
msgstr "Amathuluzi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text1"
msgstr "Ake sibheke ukuthi yimaphi amathuluzi esiwasebenzisayo ukuze sifinyelele konke lokhu. Lokhu kuyashintsha njengoba sibhekana nezinkinga ezintsha futhi sithola izixazululo ezintsha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.app"
msgstr "Iseva yohlelo lokusebenza: Flask, MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Docker."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.proxy"
msgstr "Iseva ye-proxy: Varnish."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.management"
msgstr "Ukuphathwa kweseva: Ansible, Checkmk, UFW."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.dev"
msgstr "Ukuthuthukiswa: Gitlab, Weblate, Zulip."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.onion"
msgstr "Ukusingathwa kwe-Onion static: Tor, Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text2"
msgstr "Kukhona izinqumo esizibuyekeze kaningi. Enye yazo ukuxhumana phakathi kwamaseva: sasijwayele ukusebenzisa i-Wireguard kulokhu, kodwa sathola ukuthi kwesinye isikhathi iyeka ukudlulisa noma iyiphi idatha, noma idlulisa idatha ngohlangothi olulodwa kuphela. Lokhu kwenzeka ngezinhlelo eziningana ze-Wireguard ezihlukene esizizamile, njenge-<a %(github_costela_wesher)s>wesher</a> kanye ne-<a %(github_k4yt3x_wg_meshconf)s>wg-meshconf</a>. Siphinde sazama ukuhambisa izimbobo nge-SSH, sisebenzisa i-autossh ne-sshuttle, kodwa sabhekana ne-<a %(github_sshuttle)s>izinkinga lapho</a> (nakuba kusengakacaci kimi ukuthi i-autossh ihlupheka yini ngezinkinga ze-TCP-over-TCP noma cha — kuzizwa kungathi isixazululo esingalungile kimi kodwa mhlawumbe silungile ngempela?)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text3"
msgstr "Esikhundleni salokho, sabuyela emuva ekuxhumekeni okuqondile phakathi kwamaseva, sifihla ukuthi iserver isebenza kubahlinzeki abashibhile sisebenzisa i-IP-filtering nge-UFW. Lokhu kunokubi ukuthi i-Docker ayisebenzi kahle ne-UFW, ngaphandle kokuthi usebenzise <code>network_mode: \"host\"</code>. Konke lokhu kunamaphutha amaningi, ngoba uzoveza iserver yakho ku-inthanethi ngokulungiselela okuncane. Mhlawumbe kufanele sibuyele ku-autossh — impendulo izokwamukelwa kakhulu lapha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text4"
msgstr "Siphinde sabuyela emuva ku-Varnish vs. Nginx. Njengamanje sithanda i-Varnish, kodwa inezinto ezithile ezithokozisayo nezindawo ezinzima. Lokhu kuyasebenza ku-Checkmk: asikuthandi, kodwa kuyasebenza okwamanje. I-Weblate ibe yinhle kodwa ayimangalisi — kwesinye isikhathi ngiyesaba ukuthi izolahlekelwa idatha yami noma nini lapho ngizama ukuyihlanganisa ne-git repo yethu. I-Flask ibe yinhle ngokujwayelekile, kodwa inezinto ezithile ezithokozisayo ezithathe isikhathi esiningi sokuxazulula, njengokuhlela izizinda ezenziwe ngokwezifiso, noma izinkinga zokuhlanganiswa kwe-SqlAlchemy yayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text5"
msgstr "Kuze kube manje amanye amathuluzi abe mahle: asinazo izikhalazo ezinkulu nge-MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Gitlab, Zulip, Docker, ne-Tor. Zonke lezi zibe nezinkinga ezithile, kodwa akukho okukhulu kakhulu noma okudla isikhathi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions"
msgstr "Isiphetho"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text1"
msgstr "Kube isipiliyoni esithokozisayo ukufunda ukuthi ungayisetha kanjani injini yokusesha yesithunzi esiqinile nesimelana nezinkinga. Kukhona imininingwane eminingi ongayabelana ngayo ezikhathini ezizayo, ngakho-ke ngazise ukuthi ungathanda ukufunda ngani okwengeziwe!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text2"
msgstr "Njengenjwayelo, sifuna iminikelo yokuxhasa lo msebenzi, ngakho qiniseka ukuthi uhlole ikhasi le-Donate ku-Archive ka-Anna. Siphinde sifune ezinye izinhlobo zokuxhaswa, njengemali yokuxhasa, abaxhasi besikhathi eside, abahlinzeki bezinkokhelo eziphezulu, mhlawumbe ngisho nezikhangiso (ezinokunambitheka!). Futhi uma ufuna ukufaka isandla ngesikhathi sakho namakhono, sihlala sifuna onjiniyela, abahumushi, njalonjalo. Siyabonga ngentshisekelo yakho nokusekela kwakho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.signature"
msgstr "- U-Anna nethimba (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text1"
msgstr "Sawubona, ngingu-Anna. Ngidale <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>, umtapo wolwazi omkhulu kunayo yonke emhlabeni. Lona yibhulogi yami yomuntu siqu, lapho mina neqembu lami sibhala khona ngokuqhekeza amalungelo obunikazi, ukugcinwa kwedijithali, nokunye okuningi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text2"
msgstr "Xhumana nami ku-<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.text3"
msgstr "Qaphela ukuthi le webhusayithi iyibhulogi nje kuphela. Lapha sibamba amazwi ethu kuphela. Asibambi noma sixhumanise ama-torrents noma amanye amafayela anamalungelo obunikazi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.heading"
msgstr "Okuthunyelwe kwebhulogi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.title"
msgstr "1.3B WorldCat scrape"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Ukufaka izincwadi eziyi-5,998,794 ku-IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Isixwayiso: le bhulogi isiyekile ukusebenza. Sinqume ukuthi i-IPFS ayikalungi okwamanje. Sisazoxhumanisa namafayela ku-IPFS kusuka ku-Anna’s Archive uma kungenzeka, kodwa asisazosingatha thina uqobo, futhi asisabeki ukuthi abanye basebenzise i-IPFS. Sicela ubheke ikhasi lethu le-Torrents uma ufuna ukusiza ukugcina iqoqo lethu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> I-Archive ka-Anna isuse yonke i-WorldCat (iqoqo elikhulu kunawo wonke le-metadata yomtapo wolwazi emhlabeni) ukwenza uhlu lwezincwadi ezidinga ukugcinwa.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "Ngonyaka odlule, thina <a %(blog)s>sazibophezela</a> ekuphenduleni lo mbuzo: <strong>Yimaphi amaphesenti ezincwadi ezigcinwe unomphela ngamatapo wolwazi angabonakali?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Uma incwadi isingenile kumtapo wolwazi ovulekile wedatha njenge-<a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, futhi manje <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>I-Archive ka-Anna</a>, iyaboniswa emhlabeni wonke (ngama-torrents), ngaleyo ndlela igcinwe phakade."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Ukuphendula umbuzo wokuthi yimaphi amaphesenti ezincwadi ezigcinwe, sidinga ukwazi inani eliphelele: zingaki izincwadi ezikhona? Futhi ngokufanelekile asinaso nje isibalo, kodwa i-metadata yangempela. Ngaleso sikhathi singakwazi ukuqhathanisa nezincwadi ezingabonakali, kodwa futhi <strong>senze uhlu lwezincwadi ezisele okufanele zigcinwe!</strong> Singaqala ngisho nokuphupha ngomzamo owenziwe ngabantu abaningi wokwehla kulolu hlu lwezincwadi okufanele zigcinwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "Sasuse <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, futhi salanda i-<a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, kodwa imiphumela ayenelisekile. Inkinga enkulu kwakungukuthi kwakungekho ukuhambisana okuningi kwe-ISBNs. Bheka le diagram ye-Venn kusuka ku-<a %(blog)s>okuthunyelwe kwebhulogi yethu</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "Sasimangazwe kakhulu ukuthi kwakuncane kangakanani ukuhambisana phakathi kwe-ISBNdb ne-Open Library, kokubili okuhlanganisa idatha evela emithonjeni ehlukahlukene, njengokukopisha kwewebhu namarekhodi emitatshana. Uma bobabili benza umsebenzi omuhle wokuthola iningi lama-ISBNs laphaya, izindilinga zabo ngokuqinisekile zazizoba nokuhambisana okukhulu, noma eyodwa ibe yisethi engaphansi kwenye. Kwakwenza sizibuze, zingaki izincwadi eziwela <em>ngaphandle ngokuphelele kwalezi zindilinga</em>? Sidinga isizindalwazi esikhulu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text6"
msgstr "Yilapho sabheka khona isizindalwazi esikhulu kunazo zonke sezincwadi emhlabeni: <a %(wikipedia_worldcat)s>WorldCat</a>. Lesi yisizindalwazi esingeyona inzuzo esenziwe yi-non-profit <a %(wikipedia_oclc)s>OCLC</a>, esihlanganisa amarekhodi e-metadata avela emitasheni yezincwadi emhlabeni wonke, ngokushintshanisa ngokunikeza le mitatshana ukufinyelela ku-dataset ephelele, nokuba zibonakale emiphumeleni yokusesha yabasebenzisi bokugcina."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text7"
msgstr "Noma i-OCLC ingeyona inzuzo, imodeli yabo yebhizinisi idinga ukuvikela isizindalwazi sabo. Hhayi-ke, siyaxolisa, abangani e-OCLC, sikunikeza konke. :-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text8"
msgstr "Ngonyaka odlule, siqoqe ngokucophelela wonke amarekhodi e-WorldCat. Ekuqaleni, sathola ithuba elihle. I-WorldCat yayisanda kwethula kabusha ukwakheka kwewebhusayithi yabo ephelele (ngo-Aug 2022). Lokhu kuhlanganisa ukuvuselelwa okukhulu kwezinhlelo zabo zangemuva, kwethula izimbobo eziningi zokuphepha. Sasebenzisa ithuba ngokushesha, futhi sikwazile ukuqoqa amakhulu ezigidi (!) zamarekhodi ezinsukwini ezimbalwa nje."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.alt.redesign"
msgstr "<em>Ukubuyekezwa kwe-WorldCat</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text9"
msgstr "Ngemva kwalokho, izimbobo zokuphepha zazilungiswa kancane kancane ngazinye, kwaze kwaba yilapho yokugcina esayithola ilungiswa cishe inyanga edlule. Ngaleso sikhathi sasivele sinezincwadi eziningi, futhi sasifuna kuphela amarekhodi asezingeni eliphezulu kancane. Ngakho-ke sizizwe sesilungele ukukhulula!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text10"
msgstr "Ake sibheke olunye ulwazi oluyisisekelo ngedatha:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.data.format"
msgstr "<strong>Isakhiwo?</strong> <a %(blog)s>Izikhongozeli Zokugcina Zika-Anna (AAC)</a>, okuyisisekelo <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> ezicindezelwe nge-<a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>, kanye neminye imiqondo ejwayelekile. Lezi zikhongozeli zigoqa izinhlobo ezahlukene zamarekhodi, ngokusekelwe ekuqoqweni okuhlukile esikwenzile."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.data"
msgstr "Idatha"

